#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_livechat_telegram
msgid ""
"A Telegram bot linked to a Live Chat channel can name one of the channel's "
"AI agents: a customer's new session is then the agent's, which answers every"
" message as it would a website visitor, and each answer carries a button to "
"talk to a person instead, which hands the session to an available operator."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_mobile_telegram
msgid ""
"A bot delivering Odoo notifications can be restricted to company phones: a "
"user's notifications, replies and inbox then reach only a Telegram account "
"whose number, shared by its owner and vouched for by Telegram, is the SIM "
"number of an active Mobile Phone device the user carries. A connected "
"account without a shared number is asked for it. The device form shows the "
"Telegram account of the phone's number and who it acts as."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip_device
msgid ""
"A call the phone system reports names the extension that answered it: the "
"extension's user answers for it, and a call the softphone already filed is "
"completed instead of duplicated, so its recording lands on it. A company "
"handset fetches its softphone settings, the extension and secret of its "
"user, from the device configuration route."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_captcha_turnstile
msgid ""
"A captcha provider: the forms of the captcha module get a Turnstile token "
"from a widget shown only when Cloudflare asks the visitor to interact, which"
" the server verifies through the Turnstile service, refusing tokens obtained"
" for another action. The site key is a setting; the secret key is kept in "
"the vault."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_captcha_recaptcha
msgid ""
"A captcha provider: the forms of the captcha module get an invisible "
"reCAPTCHA v3 token, which the server verifies through the reCAPTCHA service,"
" refusing scores below the configured minimum and tokens obtained for "
"another action. The site key and minimum score are settings; the secret key "
"is kept in the vault."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_account_collection_sale_fleet_trace
msgid ""
"A cash sale handed over on the route takes its goods from the stock the "
"salesperson's vehicle carries to sell"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_collection_sale_fleet
msgid ""
"A cash sale whose customer takes the goods at once is handed over at the "
"counter or from the salesperson's vehicle, not delivered: its transfer is "
"validated outside any trip even where the operation type asks deliveries to "
"leave in trips, and it needs no photo of a signed slip, the collection's "
"receipt being the customer's acknowledgement."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_training_simulator
msgid ""
"A catalogue of training simulators by area and the record of every session: "
"who played, which scenario, how long, the errors and the result. Each "
"simulator lives in its own module and plays on a snapshot of real data taken"
" when the session starts; what happens in the game is kept only in the "
"session, so production records are never touched. The tests of each "
"simulator prove it with TrainingNeutralityCase."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/base/models/ir_access_changeset.py:0
msgid "A change set is created a draft of the person staging it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
