"A training game for drivers, supervisors and warehouse clerks: a CDG "
"delivery trip built from the deliveries ready to go today on each route of "
"the calendar, with their sale orders, reserved lots, credit verdict, people "
"and vehicle, and the vehicle's real GPS track of a reference day. The player"
" walks the whole flow (sale order, approval, credit, SHIP, authorization, "
"loading, delivery, return) with the driver's phone and a barcode reader, in "
"eight scenarios. It reads production data through a read-only privilege and "
