"independent website designer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iot_six
msgid ""
"Adds TIM interface discovery and terminal transaction, cancellation and "
"balance actions using the native library loader. Requires a compatible "
"terminal, the TIM library and the IoT runtime. The corresponding POS addon "
"connects these device actions to point-of-sale payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_digest_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds Telegram delivery and a test-send action to digests. Requires a "
"configured Telegram bot and a chat linked to the recipient; delivery "
"settings control email replacement, duplication and fallback."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_vn_edi_viettel
msgid ""
"Adds Viettel invoice preparation, submission, adjustment and cancellation "
"workflows, with service status and PDF or XML retrieval. Requires connection"
" credentials and configured invoice templates and symbols."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp
msgid ""
"Adds WhatsApp accounts, templates, message records and webhook handling "
"linked to Discuss conversations. Supports template submission and message "
"delivery-status tracking. Requires a configured business account, service "
"credentials and a reachable webhook; storing account secrets requires the "
"server credential encryption key."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marketing_automation_whatsapp
msgid ""
"Adds WhatsApp activity execution, message statistics and tracked links to "
"campaigns. Requires a configured WhatsApp account and usable message "
"templates."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_sign
msgid ""
"Adds WhatsApp as a signing communication channel with access links, "
"completion messages and attachment downloads. Requires configured approved "
"message templates, WhatsApp service access and signer phone numbers; "
"document signing remains in the Sign dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_account_followup
msgid ""
"Adds WhatsApp delivery to follow-up levels and the follow-up wizard. "
"Requires a configured WhatsApp account, a usable template and a recipient "
"number."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_us_direct_deposit
msgid ""
"Adds Wise recipient matching, batch submission and links to complete funding"
" in Wise. Requires configured Wise credentials and profile, eligible bank "
"details and the Wise payment method. Non-USD and scheduled payments are not "
"supported by this integration; creating a batch does not fund it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_twitter
msgid ""
"Adds X account authorization, publishing and stream synchronization to "
"Social Publishing. Requires provider credentials and permissions for the "
"selected accounts; available operations depend on the provider API and "
"account access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_3way_match
msgid ""
"Adds Yes, No and Exception payment-review statuses, a manual override and "
"accounting dashboard filters. Matching follows the product billing policy: "
"ordered-quantity billing compares ordered and invoiced quantities, while "
"received-quantity billing considers receipts. Missing purchase links or "
"price differences produce exceptions; the status is not an unconditional "
"receipt-based payment lock."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_youtube
msgid ""
"Adds YouTube account authorization, publishing and stream synchronization to"
" Social Publishing. Requires provider credentials and permissions for the "
"selected channels; available operations depend on the provider API and "
"account access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_agro_surface_map_threed
msgid ""
"Adds a 3D switch to the SIAP market map: each municipality is an extruded "
"column whose height is its share of the highest value shown, coloured, "
"selected and dimmed like the 2D map, with orbit controls, hover and the same"
" cross-filtering clicks. The scene is built on the first switch and kept: "
"back on the 2D map it is hidden and stops drawing. Needs WebGL; without it "
"the view says so."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_event_iot
msgid ""
"Adds a 96x82 mm badge format, printer report templates and check-in printing"
" integration. Requires a configured compatible printer and IoT connection; "
"the supplied printer report emits ESC/Label commands."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_adyen
msgid ""
"Adds a Adyen terminal payment method and the POS request and response "
"handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured "
"provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_hr_expense
msgid ""
"Adds a Documents action for image and PDF files that are not shortcuts or "
"already linked to an expense. The user must be linked to an employee. Also "
"adds expense document counts and navigation; this extension does not promise"
" automatic import of every expense attachment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_fr_fec_import
msgid ""
"Adds a FEC import wizard with account mapping, journal and contact creation,"
" and journal-entry grouping and balancing checks. Supports the implemented "
"delimited-text input path; importing a file does not certify its fiscal "
"correctness or submit it to an authority."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_gps
msgid ""
"Adds a GPS-device link and related telemetry to resource assets and their "
"stock-lot interfaces. Extends GPS reports with asset identity and provides a"
" scheduled odometer-recording action. Requires a configured GPS device and "
"incoming telemetry; this bridge does not itself obtain positions from "
"tracker hardware."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_add_gln
msgid ""
"Adds a Global Location Number field to partner records and exposes it on "
"their forms."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_iot_ingenico
msgid ""
"Adds a Ingenico terminal choice and POS payment interface for the IoT "
"integration. Requires a supported terminal connected to a configured IoT "
"installation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iot_camera
msgid ""
"Adds a Linux camera interface and capture driver for devices recognized by "
"the IoT runtime. Requires a compatible camera and operating-system capture "
"support. Business applications request captures through the IoT connection; "
"the addon does not provide a standalone surveillance or video-recording "
"application."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger_maintenance_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds a Maintenance submenu under Manufacturing with links to machinery "
"assets, maintenance plans and maintenance orders. The actions and "
"maintenance behavior are implemented by Asset Ledger Maintenance; this addon"
" contributes menu records only."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_mercado_pago
msgid ""
"Adds a Mercado Pago terminal payment method and the POS request and response"
" handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured"
" provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_mollie
msgid ""
"Adds a Mollie terminal payment method and the POS request and response "
"handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured "
"provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_qfpay
msgid ""
"Adds a QFPay terminal payment method and the POS request and response "
"handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured "
"provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_saft_import
msgid ""
"Adds a SAF-T XML import wizard that maps accounts, partners, taxes, journals"
" and entries and can prepare opening-balance adjustments. Country extensions"
" adapt specific layouts; the importer does not claim to support every "
"national SAF-T variant."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_agro_surface_map_account
msgid ""
"Adds a SIAP segment to product categories, inherited by subcategories, and a"
" read-only report of posted customer invoice lines by municipality and "
"segment. A line is placed at the delivery or customer address: its city, "
"else the municipality set on the contact, else the municipality of its "
"postal code (l10n_mx_partner), else only its state; each line says which. "
"The market map gains Sales, Penetration and Opportunity metrics per segment "
"and opens these lines as records. Amounts compare with a market priced in "
"USD: a USD company keeps its amount, pesos convert at the map's rate, other "
"currencies at the rate of the invoice date, and what cannot be converted is "
"reported apart. Every journal counts unless another module restricts them."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_se_sie4_export
msgid ""
"Adds a SIE 4 export action to the general ledger report using the selected "
"reporting dates and company data. Produces a file for use outside the "
"application; it does not transmit a tax return or validate another system "
"import."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_se_sie4_import
msgid ""
"Adds a SIE 4 text import wizard for company, account and verification "
"records. Opening balances require the import option and are limited to "
"current-year #IB 0 records; other opening-balance years are ignored. The "
"parser tries UTF-8 and falls back to ISO-8859-1."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_se_sie_import
msgid ""
"Adds a SIE 5 import wizard with company checks, signature verification "
"against the company's trusted signer certificates under a per-company "
"signature policy, account and partner mapping, journal entry creation and "
"balance adjustments. Embedded document import is optional; only the "
"implemented XML record structures are handled, not arbitrary accounting "
"exports."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_iot_six
msgid ""
"Adds a SIX terminal choice and POS payment interface for the IoT "
"integration. Requires a supported terminal connected to a configured IoT "
"installation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_stripe
msgid ""
"Adds a Stripe terminal payment method and the POS request and response "
"handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured "
"provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_molecular_screening_agro
msgid ""
"Adds a Systemic flag to compounds, read from the most recent 'systemic' "
"property, with a list column, a search filter and a count of systemic "
"candidates on each campaign. Adds an Import SDF wizard on campaigns that "
"reads the 3D export of the AgroMarin screening pipeline, whose data tags are"
" Spanish (masa_molecular, carga_formal, motivo, detalle), with the drawing "
"stage's JSON as an optional companion for SVG, TPSA, hydrogen-bond counts, "
"the systemic flag and compound classes. Each imported value is stored with "
"the method declared on the wizard."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_speech
msgid ""
"Adds a Transcribe action and related transcript text, state and availability"
" fields to documents. Delegates transcription to the speech attachment "
"implementation and exposes its subtitle helper; supported recordings and "
"speech-provider configuration are determined by that dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_trace_gps_geoengine
msgid ""
"Adds a View GPS Track button to delivery trips: it draws the vehicle's GPS "
"trail between departure and return on the trail map, with the trip's planned"
" stops, what happened at each (arrival, delivery, not delivered), the "
"incidents and the GPS alerts marked where they happened. The printed trip "
"sheet carries the same as a route map, with each stop numbered as the sheet "
"sequences it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_viva_com
msgid ""
"Adds a Viva.com terminal payment method and the POS request and response "
"handling for that integration. Requires a supported terminal and configured "
"provider credentials or payment-provider account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_calendar
msgid ""
"Adds a WhatsApp alarm type and sends reminders through the configured "
"template and responsible account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_iot_worldline
msgid ""
"Adds a Worldline terminal choice and POS payment interface for the IoT "
"integration. Requires a supported terminal connected to a configured IoT "
"installation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_account_iso20022
msgid ""
"Adds a bank-journal selection and SEPA payment-file export to payroll "
"payment reports, with employee IBAN validation. Bank acceptance depends on "
"the configured payment format and account data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip
msgid ""
"Adds a browser softphone, provider and user credentials, call history and "
"activity queues. Requires a compatible SIP provider, its connection settings"
" and browser media permissions; installing the addon alone does not supply a"
" telephone service or phone number."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ph_check_printing
msgid ""
"Adds a check report, payment and accounting configuration views and report "
"styling. Requires matching check stationery and printer calibration; "
"numbering and payment workflows come from the check-printing dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_tw_edi_ecpay_website_sale
msgid ""
"Adds a checkout step for invoice carrier, donation and print options, "
"validates supported identifiers and copies the values to invoices. Requires "
"ECPay to be enabled for the company."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_substance
msgid ""
"Adds a chemical-substance registry with CAS-format and checksum validation, "
"chemical identity fields and categorized property records. Products can link"
" to shared substance records, and the module includes seed data. Identifier "
"validation checks structure; substance properties remain entered or imported"
" reference data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_credit_partner_scoring
msgid ""
"Adds a commercial-score dimension to the credit scorecard and displays the "
"customer’s commercial tier on credit profiles and reviews. The observer "
"returns no measurement for a partner without score lines, so an unscored "
"customer does not contribute a zero score. Requires both credit management "
"and partner scoring."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_fr_hr_holidays
msgid ""
"Adds a company reference leave type and adjusts leave date ranges and "
"durations for the applicable French employee schedules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_mrp_subcontracting
msgid ""
"Adds a component-details action to subcontracting lines in the barcode "
"picking interface. It saves the current transfer before opening the stock "
"move action and hides the action for done or cancelled lines; subcontracting"
" processing comes from the dependent modules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_reports_cash_basis
msgid ""
"Adds a configurable cash-basis report filter and computes report queries "
"through temporary journal-item tables using payment and reconciliation data."
" Supports report labels and drill-down adaptations; the filter must be "
"enabled on the report and selected in its options."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_tax_python
msgid ""
"Adds a custom formula tax type evaluated in server and browser tax "
"computations. Expressions use the tax base, unit price, quantity and "
"permitted nonrelational product or unit fields, subject to an operator and "
"function allowlist. Configured formulas replace the amount calculation; "
"there is no separate applicability script."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_customer
msgid ""
"Adds a customer reference listing, detail templates and contact publication "
"controls, with map integration supplied by the dependencies. Display depends"
" on configured customer records and publication; this addon does not promise"
" lead generation or commercial results."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_discount
msgid ""
"Adds a discount control and configured discount product to POS orders. "
"Cashier input is limited to a percentage between zero and one hundred; the "
"POS discount implementation creates discount lines using the applicable tax "
"groups. Requires the discount feature and product configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ke_hr_payroll_document
msgid ""
"Adds a document count button and hides the save warning on the tax deduction"
" card form. This addon contains a view adaptation; payroll form generation "
"and storage are implemented by its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_telegram_ml
msgid ""
"Adds a guided request-intake flow, optional model-based category "
"suggestions, manual category selection and confirmation before creation. "
"Uses the model gateway for classification and speech services for eligible "
"voice notes. Requires enabled commands, linked internal users and configured"
" approval categories; AI service access is needed only for the enabled AI "
"features."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_hr_referral
msgid ""
"Adds a job action and referral message template for the WhatsApp composer. "
"Requires a configured WhatsApp account and recipient number."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_crm
msgid ""
"Adds a lead-creation wizard for social stream posts and comments, customer "
"matching and UTM defaults. Social post statistics count leads sharing the "
"recorded source; they do not establish that the post caused a sale."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_maintenance_mode
msgid ""
"Adds a maintenance switch and configurable response page with bypass rules "
"for user groups, IP addresses or ranges and endpoint patterns. Evaluates "
"requests through the HTTP dispatch extension. Requires deliberate bypass "
"configuration so needed administrative or integration routes remain "
"available."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_google_map
msgid ""
"Adds a map page and template using published contact addresses and "
"coordinates. The route accepts selected company contact IDs or a domain "
"supplied by an extension and uses the website Google Maps API key; it does "
"not publish unselected contacts automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_enterprise
msgid ""
"Adds a map view to the sales-order action using the geographic data of the "
"related customer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_product_matrix
msgid ""
"Adds a mixin that loads product variant grids, applies edited quantities and"
" prepares report grids for adopting order models. Nonzero quantity changes "
"are refused when a variant matches multiple eligible order lines; sales and "
"purchase extensions supply their interface and direction-specific rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_hourly_cost
msgid ""
"Adds a nonnegative monetary hourly cost visible to HR users and its employee"
" form field. Converts existing costs when the employee changes company "
"currency unless a new cost is supplied; downstream modules must implement "
"the valuation of worked time."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_sale_commission
msgid ""
"Adds a payslip input type to commission plans and aggregates matching "
"commission report entries for each employee user, company and payslip "
"payment-date range. Amounts are converted to the payslip currency; salary "
"rules and payroll payment processing are supplied by Payroll."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_mass_mailing_sms
msgid ""
"Adds a phone-number variant of the website newsletter block and adapts "
"subscription handling to its phone field. Requires a configured mailing list"
" and the SMS mailing dependency; adding a subscriber does not itself send a "
"campaign."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning_attendance
msgid ""
"Adds a planning and attendance analysis report and reporting menus. "
"Comparisons use stored planning slots and attendance records; the addon does"
" not record attendance or infer work performed outside those records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_comparison
msgid ""
"Adds a product comparison page, comparison controls and attribute categories"
" that organize the table. Also supplies a product-page attribute summary "
"template; useful comparisons require populated product attributes and do not"
" guarantee faster purchasing decisions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_product_matrix
msgid ""
"Adds a product grid-entry mode, sales order interface and report grids "
"through the shared order matrix mixin. Configurable products must use the "
"matrix mode; combo lines are excluded, and ambiguous nonzero quantity "
"changes across multiple matching lines are refused."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_stock
msgid ""
"Adds a project field to stock transfers and project actions for receipts, "
"deliveries and all related transfers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_task_device_visit
msgid ""
"Adds a project opt-in, a SQL reconciliation report, a weekly vehicle report "
"and a wizard to rebuild visits from recorded GPS positions. Classifies "
"coverage using task assignments, customer geofences and recorded dwell time."
" Requires PostGIS and matching employee, vehicle and location data; missing "
"coverage is reported as unverifiable rather than proof of absence."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_scoring_crm
msgid ""
"Adds a related customer tier field, lead view integration and a registered "
"scoring-frequency field. The tier follows the commercial partner; predictive"
" scoring uses the existing CRM mechanism and its configured fields."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_sale
msgid ""
"Adds a sales order reference and order state on tickets and exposes that "
"reference in ticket and SLA analysis. It supplies sales context for other "
"after-sales extensions; it does not itself create returns or credit notes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_online_payment_self_order
msgid ""
"Adds a self-order online payment method and links provider transaction "
"confirmation to the order payment status. Requires a configured online "
"payment provider."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_service
msgid ""
"Adds a service indicator and selection-domain helper to sales lines. When "
"the requesting context enables unit prices, duplicate service-product lines "
"on one order include their price in the additional display name; service "
"applications must use these helpers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_es_pos
msgid ""
"Adds a simplified-invoice journal setting, partner handling and simplified-"
"invoice numbering for Spanish POS configurations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_spreadsheet_report_formula
msgid ""
"Adds a spreadsheet function and batched server lookup for report expressions"
" selected by report reference, line code, expression label and period. "
"Supports company and unposted-entry options and uses the report engine for "
"evaluation; the report and expression must exist and the user must have "
"applicable access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_stock_lot_select
msgid ""
"Adds a stock-verification popup with available quantities, lot selection and"
" kit-component handling. Stores selected locations and lots on order lines "
"and uses them when preparing stock movements. Requires online stock lookup "
"and configured products and locations; displayed availability is a reading "
"at selection time, not a reservation against concurrent sales."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_scoring_sale
msgid ""
"Adds a stored order tier and a confirmation snapshot used by sales "
"reporting. A nonempty snapshot takes precedence over the current customer "
"tier; if no tier was captured, the displayed tier continues to follow the "
"commercial partner."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds a storefront quantity endpoint and sale-order calculations for kits and"
" their components already present in the cart. Uses phantom bills of "
"materials and free component stock to adjust availability; stock management "
"and checkout are supplied by dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_fsm
msgid ""
"Adds a task-creation wizard, task links and a default field service project "
"on helpdesk teams. Creating a task requires a customer and a field service "
"project; the ticket remains linked to the generated task."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_timesheet
msgid ""
"Adds a timesheet project on helpdesk teams, ticket time entries and timers, "
"and time totals in ticket analysis. Requires timesheets enabled on the team "
"and its project; sales billing is provided by a separate extension."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger_website_sale
msgid ""
"Adds a vehicle catalog route, quote-only product settings and a per-website "
"WhatsApp destination. Supplied templates replace the cart call to action for"
" quote-only products with a quote link. Requires published catalog products "
"and a configured destination; the module provides presentation and links "
"rather than a WhatsApp messaging service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sms
msgid ""
"Adds a visitor action that checks the linked contact for phone records and "
"opens the SMS composer for that contact. Requires a usable destination "
"number and SMS service configuration; anonymous visits alone provide no "
"phone number."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voice_command_ml
msgid ""
"Adds a voice-command fallback that sends the sentence and offered action "
"choices through the machine-learning gateway under the voice.intent purpose."
" Requires an eligible configured model and policy. Returned action IDs are "
"filtered against the offered choices and passed to the voice proposal "
"workflow; this addon does not itself execute arbitrary model instructions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_data_merge_stock_account
msgid ""
"Adds a warning to deduplication model configuration for products when "
"inventory accounting is installed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_website_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds a website-builder snippet, agent selection and routes to create the "
"corresponding chat channel. Requires a configured AI agent and livechat "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_website_sale
msgid ""
"Adds a website-specific WhatsApp template setting and sends the selected "
"template when applicable website orders are confirmed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_collect_wishlist
msgid ""
"Adds a wishlist action to the pickup delivery form for products unavailable "
"at the selected pickup location."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_edi_payment_preview
msgid ""
"Adds a wizard and report that build payment-complement values from current "
"invoice reconciliations without sending the preview to a PAC. Marks output "
"as unsigned and checks for related invoices lacking stamped UUIDs. Requires "
"Mexican EDI payment configuration; an older payment’s installment number may"
" differ when reconciliation state has changed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_esg_csrd
msgid ""
"Adds a wizard that requests metric suggestions from an AI service and lets "
"users select which suggestions to create. Requires a configured provider and"
" review of generated content."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_update_tax_tags
msgid ""
"Adds a wizard under accounting settings in developer mode to rebuild tax-tag"
" links for the selected company from a starting date. Uses the current tax "
"repartition configuration and rejects child taxes shared by multiple parent "
"taxes; review the period and configuration before applying it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_stock
msgid ""
"Adds abstract order and line transfer tracking, delivery-delay and stock-"
"match report helpers, and extensions for order links on stock moves and "
"pickings. Also supplies a user warehouse default. Sales and purchase stock "
"bridges implement their concrete logistics flows."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_fiscal_categories
msgid ""
"Adds account fiscal categories and dated deduction rates, with a report that"
" groups balances and deductible amounts by category, account and rate."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds account-statement commands with period selection, PDF delivery and "
"request logs. Self-service uses the linked partner; querying other customers"
" requires a linked internal user who reads the partner ledger in Odoo "
"(accounting read access); a linked customer gets their own statement only. "
"Requires a configured bot and accounting report access; there is no separate"
" manager-role field on the chat."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_base_import
msgid ""
"Adds accounting import entry points, setup views and import summaries. "
"Account loading can match existing accounts, and journal-item loading "
"separates move headers from lines before creating entries; imported data "
"still needs appropriate accounts, journals and mappings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_accountant
msgid ""
"Adds accounting menus, views and access-group configuration over the "
"accounting dependencies. Enables the invoice in-payment state, extends "
"review eligibility and maintains tax-return journal dashboard visibility. "
"Installation initializes accounting onboarding and conditionally requests "
"the cash-basis reporting addon for configured country cases."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_accountant
msgid ""
"Adds accounting settings for inventory valuation and the associated "
"valuation-report definitions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_autocomplete
msgid ""
"Adds address lookup to the website sale checkout through the address "
"provider chosen in the settings, called with each website's own key so "
"visitors never spend the one internal users' lookups are made with. Without "
"a provider or a website key, the checkout suggests nothing."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds agent selection to livechat rules and manages agent participation and "
"response routes. Supports forwarding between scripted chatbots, AI agents "
"and human operators; generation requires an AI provider."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_sepa_direct_debit
msgid ""
"Adds an IBAN checkout form, mandate-linked payment tokens and matching of "
"initial pending transactions to bank statement lines. Requires a company "
"creditor identifier and an IBAN payment journal. Reused active mandates can "
"confirm transactions before bank collection; payment records must still be "
"submitted to the bank through the accounting workflow. This addon does not "
"contact a bank API."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_sms
msgid ""
"Adds an SMS action to applicant records using the shared message composer "
"and configured SMS service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_sms
msgid ""
"Adds an SMS template to helpdesk stages and sends it on applicable ticket "
"creation or stage changes through the configured SMS service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_server_actions
msgid ""
"Adds an Update with AI evaluation mode and prompt to field-write server "
"actions. Uses the AI field implementation and configured provider to "
"generate the selected stored field value."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_move_name_sequence
msgid ""
"Adds an accounting setting to use journal-specific sequences, including "
"separate refund sequences. Provides sequence initialization from existing "
"move numbers and a resequencing wizard."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_password_policy
msgid ""
"Adds an administrator setting for minimum password length and validates "
"passwords against that policy when they are changed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_tool_approval
msgid ""
"Adds an approval category setting on server-action tools and records "
"proposed calls with arguments, subject, requester and optional assignee. "
"Tools without a category retain their inherited execution flow. Approved "
"calls use the assigned user or requester context; the addon also provides "
"model-operation permissions for tools that explicitly check them."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_mail_plugin
msgid ""
"Adds an authenticated mail-plugin ticket-creation endpoint and contact "
"ticket listings. The endpoint requires an existing contact and ticket "
"creation rights; mail content logging extends the plugin model whitelist. A "
"compatible configured mailbox client is required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_spreadsheet_dashboard_edition
msgid ""
"Adds an editor action, spreadsheet metadata and cell-thread access checks "
"for dashboards."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_hr
msgid ""
"Adds an employee relation to device records and employee fields for assigned"
" devices and their count. Provides actions to open those devices and GPS "
"tracking history. Assignment is independent of the device protocol; tracking"
" actions require the GPS data supplied by the declared dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_esg_hr
msgid ""
"Adds an employee reporting model and dashboard data based on gender, "
"department, leadership, country and wage records. Results depend on the "
"completeness of employee data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_acerta
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the Acerta "
"file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-entry"
" codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_group_s
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the Group S"
" file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-"
"entry codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_partena
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the Partena"
" file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-"
"entry codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_prisma
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the Prisma "
"file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-entry"
" codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_sd_worx
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the SD Worx"
" file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-"
"entry codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_ucm
msgid ""
"Adds an export workflow for selected employees and periods using the UCM "
"file layout. Requires the provider-specific company, employee and work-entry"
" codes configured in this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_imin
msgid ""
"Adds an iMin printer adapter and detection when the POS other-devices "
"setting is enabled. Requires compatible hardware and its reachable printer "
"service; receipt printing uses the bundled client library and can use an "
"existing fallback printer when the iMin device is disconnected or off."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_substance_autocomplete
msgid ""
"Adds an on-demand lookup through the configured integration service using a "
"substance name or CAS number. Uses the first returned compound and a CAS-"
"shaped synonym to fill missing CAS, chemical name, formula and molecular "
"weight fields. Requires service access and review of ambiguous matches; "
"existing populated fields are preserved."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_skills_event
msgid ""
"Adds an onsite course type, an event reference, display defaults and "
"training-related views for resume entries. This addon does not implement an "
"event-completion hook that automatically creates resume entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_scan_confirms
msgid ""
"Adds an operation-type option that changes barcode quantity handling and "
"checks quantities before transfer validation. Provides an over-demand "
"approver and reason for explicit exceptions while retaining the stock checks"
" supplied by the addon. Requires the option on the operation type; this "
"behavior is not enabled for every transfer merely by installation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_tender_agreement
msgid ""
"Adds an optional agreements award mode to adopting tender models; orders "
"remain the default. Creates and confirms one agreement per winning offer "
"with awarded quantities, discounted unit prices and tender dates, then "
"cancels the linked offer while marking its outcome won. Concrete sales or "
"purchase bridges provide the agreement models."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_expired_lot_guard
msgid ""
"Adds an outgoing operation-type option for expiration checks in reservation,"
" barcode scanning and transfer validation. Records an authorized approver "
"and reason for transfer-level exceptions. Requires configured lot expiration"
" dates and the operation-type option; lots without applicable expiration "
"data cannot be classified from dates that are absent."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_stock_account
msgid ""
"Adds analytic-cost configuration to operation types, prepares stock-move "
"analytic entries and reports those costs on projects."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marketing_automation_website_sale
msgid ""
"Adds anniversary, purchase follow-up and repeat-customer campaign templates "
"with e-commerce mailing layouts."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_appointment_hr_recruitment
msgid ""
"Adds applicant invitation codes and booking URL parameters. When a booking "
"includes a matching applicant code, the generated calendar event receives "
"the applicant link; the addon does not infer an applicant for unrelated "
"appointments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_sign
msgid ""
"Adds applicant signature counts and a wizard to choose templates, signers "
"and message content. Links applicable signature records when an applicant "
"becomes an employee."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_hr_recruitment_skills
msgid ""
"Adds applicant skills from extraction results using exact case-insensitive "
"catalog-name matching. Leaves existing applicant skills and levels "
"unchanged, ignores unknown names and skips skills without a level; new "
"entries use the default level or the first available level. CV reading comes"
" from the extraction dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip_hr_recruitment
msgid ""
"Adds application counts and navigation to call records, with applicant "
"access checks and caller data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_stock
msgid ""
"Adds approval bindings for transfer validation and counted-inventory "
"application, product-category and location flags, and inventory adjustment "
"records. Links approved requests to stock operations and checks intervening "
"stock moves for inventory counts. Automatic validation after approval is a "
"company setting; applicable rules determine the approval requirement."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_res_users_deletion
msgid ""
"Adds approval requests to the account deletion queue and excludes pending or"
" refused approvals from the deletion scheduler. The supplied self-service "
"rule automatically approves requests; disable it and configure review steps "
"to require human review. Queue rows without an approval state remain "
"eligible under the inherited deletion conditions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_physical
msgid ""
"Adds archive locations, barcoded containers (lever-arch files, hanging "
"folders, boxes), document transfer records, a transfer wizard for intake, "
"loans, returns and other movements, and a scan wizard that files or lends "
"whole containers from a barcode reader. Tracks the current location and "
"custodian, registers intake when a storage location is assigned and reminds "
"the lender the day before a loan is due and once it is overdue. Document "
"types can require an original and a storage location; users must record "
"physical movements to keep these records current."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_knowledge
msgid ""
"Adds article access-request pages and an approval adapter that invites the "
"requester with the granted role. The supplied category uses internal article"
" editors and system administrators as reviewers; eligibility depends on the "
"article request route and existing permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_gps_geoengine
msgid ""
"Adds asset and operator selection to the GPS trail wizard, labels to map "
"devices and links on client visits. Supplies speed-event, daily-speed and "
"vehicle-stop reports and a scheduled critical-speed alert action. Uses the "
"GPS geospatial and asset-operator dependencies and requires recorded "
"positions and configured alert settings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_account_asset
msgid ""
"Adds asset counts and navigation to projects based on their accounting "
"relationships."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_resource_asset_account
msgid ""
"Adds asset references to accounting lines, derives asset logs from bills and"
" links installed parts to their bill lines. Flagged part reviews can hold "
"related bill payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech
msgid ""
"Adds attachment transcript state, timed cues, speaker records, vocabulary, "
"subtitle routes and transcription actions. Extends media timelines with "
"joined transcripts and provides live chunk and dictation infrastructure. "
"Requires a separately installed and usable transcription or synthesis "
"engine; this addon ships no engine and cannot transcribe every stored "
"recording on its own."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_attendance_gantt
msgid ""
"Adds attendance Gantt views with working-hour availability, overtime "
"progress and links to attendance details."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_work_entry_attendance
msgid ""
"Adds attendance as a work-entry source, links entries to attendance and "
"overtime records and updates them when the source attendance changes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_attendance
msgid ""
"Adds attendance counts and navigation to payslips and adapts overtime "
"worked-day handling to attendance rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_accountant_knowledge
msgid ""
"Adds audit-report records, article templates and PDF assembly with attached "
"documents and accounting report content. Users supply and review the report "
"narrative."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_document
msgid ""
"Adds authenticated access-request pages for eligible document links and a "
"document approval-access adapter. The supplied category routes review to the"
" owner and document managers; approval grants the requested role through "
"document sharing. Shortcut requests must target the underlying document."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_phone_call
msgid ""
"Adds authenticated device routes for call-log batches and call recordings, "
"on the companion app's wire contract, and the phone-system device category. "
"Each reported call becomes a phone call of the device's company, matched to "
"a contact and to the device's user; a recording is filed on the call it "
"belongs to, and one that arrives ahead of its call-log entry makes a call "
"that the entry completes on arrival."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_mail_plugin
msgid ""
"Adds authenticated plugin routes for project search, project creation and "
"task creation from email subject and body, plus project contact data and "
"task logging support. Requires a compatible mail plugin, a bearer token with"
" the declared Outlook scope and access to the target records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_check_printing
msgid ""
"Adds bank-journal check sequences, payment check numbers, printing actions "
"and layout settings. Printing requires a compatible check-layout addon, "
"selected journal or company layout and suitable stationery; this addon "
"supplies no country-specific check template."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds barcode actions for production orders, component and by-product move "
"lines, lot selection and partial-production handling."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_picking_batch
msgid ""
"Adds batch creation, selection, confirmation and cancellation actions with "
"shared barcode data for the included transfers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_accountant_batch_payment
msgid ""
"Adds batch-payment selection and removal to bank reconciliation and exposes "
"the journal items belonging to a batch."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_blog
msgid ""
"Adds blogs, posts, tags, publication controls and website routes for reading"
" and searching posts. Provides feed generation and integration with website "
"editing and messaging. Authors maintain the content and choose which posts "
"to publish."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_event_booth
msgid ""
"Adds booth categories, event-type booth templates, availability counts and "
"reservation confirmation with contact details. Booth sales and online "
"booking require their respective extension modules; this addon provides the "
"event booth records and reservation workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_bot_hr
msgid ""
"Adds bot status and notification fields to the user form supplied by the HR "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_account_budget
msgid ""
"Adds budget totals, progress and line navigation to the project panel and "
"includes budget information in project updates."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_speech
msgid ""
"Adds call recording controls, timed media uploads and call transcript "
"displays, plus message read-aloud actions. Uploads require current call "
"membership, an accepted audio or video type and a valid time span. "
"Transcription is queued only when supported; transcription and synthesis "
"require configured speech engines."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_workorder_iot
msgid ""
"Adds camera capture to picture checks, workcenter trigger information and "
"IoT printer targeting for quality reports. The camera path requires a "
"configured IoT box and device identifier; measurement handling may be "
"supplied by additional quality extensions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marketing_automation_crm
msgid ""
"Adds campaign templates that create CRM call activities and change lead "
"priorities through server actions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_wallet_reorder
msgid ""
"Adds card minimum and maximum balance rules, top-up products and procurement"
" actions. Considers existing purchase lines when calculating a refill and "
"groups procurement by wallet account and company. Requires current balance "
"snapshots, an issuer vendor and purchasing configuration; a purchase order "
"does not itself transfer funds to the issuer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_expense_stripe
msgid ""
"Adds cardholder and card-management workflows, issuing-account configuration"
" and webhook processing for authorizations, transactions and funding events."
" Links card expenses to accounting records. Requires an eligible Stripe "
"Issuing account and the configured proxy and credential setup."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_tw_edi_ecpay_pos
msgid ""
"Adds carrier numbers, donation codes and print preferences to POS orders and"
" forwards them to generated invoices. Validates supported codes through the "
"configured ECPay service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_fedex
msgid ""
"Adds carrier radius configuration and FedEx location requests with address "
"and opening-hour formatting. Requires configured FedEx service access and a "
"supported pickup flow; the addon does not maintain its own pickup-point "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_analytics
msgid ""
"Adds category and approver SQL reports plus dashboard metrics and reporting "
"menus for the Approvals application. Calculates request-state counts, "
"approval and response times, workload and configured SLA comparisons from "
"approval records; results depend on recorded workflow dates and category "
"targets."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_automation
msgid ""
"Adds category automation settings and runtime references on approval "
"requests. Active bindings with a reset condition receive a managed "
"automation rule whose before-and-after filters detect entry into the "
"condition and invoke approval coverage reset. Clearing the condition or "
"disabling the binding removes its managed reset rule."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_mrp_certificate
msgid ""
"Adds certificate quality points and a completion wizard to capture product "
"pH, water pH and color. Stores the measurements with the production order "
"and supplies a printable certificate."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_latam_check
msgid ""
"Adds check payment methods and records for own and third-party checks, "
"including receipts, transfers and returns. Tracks check details and their "
"payment operations in accounting. Recording a check here does not issue an "
"electronic check through a bank."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ca_check_printing
msgid ""
"Adds check report templates, page information and layout configuration for "
"Canadian check printing. Requires suitable check stationery and printer "
"alignment; payment and check numbering workflows come from the check-"
"printing dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_do_check_printing
msgid ""
"Adds check templates, payment page values and layout settings for Dominican "
"Republic check printing. Requires suitable stationery and printer alignment;"
" this addon formats check output and does not execute a bank payment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_ups
msgid ""
"Adds checkout routes for setting or clearing the UPS account and checking "
"carrier service availability. The selected carrier must enable bill-my-"
"account; shipment rating and account acceptance depend on the UPS "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_eu_iot_scale_cert
msgid ""
"Adds checksum comparisons for a fixed list of scale-related files, weighing "
"controls and receipt details to the IoT POS scale flow. The checks are "
"enabled for configured electronic scales in companies belonging to the "
"Europe country group. Includes a rounding-configuration helper; these checks"
" do not establish certification of this fork or its deployment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_cloud_storage
msgid ""
"Adds cloud attachment types, upload and download hooks and a minimum-file-"
"size setting. A provider addon and storage configuration are required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voice_command
msgid ""
"Adds command interpretation, voice UI controls, screen integration hooks, "
"form-field dictation and spoken feedback through browser synthesis. A "
"command is heard by the browser's recogniser or, through speech, by a server"
" engine the company's policy allows, without keeping the audio. Supported "
"changes or confirmations are staged in the current interface. Requires "
"browser permissions and an available engine; command coverage depends on the"
" active screen, language and registered handlers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_commission
msgid ""
"Adds commission plans and rules, referrers on sales and invoices, and "
"commission purchase-order links. Processes commissions through invoice "
"payment and reversal hooks and provides scheduled purchase-order "
"confirmation according to settings. Amounts depend on configured rules and "
"eligible sales documents."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_blackbox_be
msgid ""
"Adds communication with a Belgian fiscal data module, receipt registration, "
"staff clock events and fiscal journal reports. Requires configured IoT "
"hardware, receipt printing and company and employee identifiers. Fiscal mode"
" restricts order editing and incompatible POS features; this fork is not "
"represented as a certified deployment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_hr
msgid ""
"Adds company HR folder configuration, employee folders and document links on"
" employee records. Folder creation and filing depend on HR document "
"settings; an employee does not receive access to the HR-only employee folder"
" by default."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_gateway_ml
msgid ""
"Adds company-purpose policy checks, credential-vault lookup, gateway "
"transport selection and Anthropic model integration to AI services. Missing "
"usable vault keys fall back to inherited credential lookup. File or raw-data"
" requests and requests without a transport service retain inherited "
"transport after the policy check; configured models and provider access are "
"required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_scale_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds component weighing progress, tolerance checks, scale-device settings, "
"employee capture and cancellation reasons to manufacturing. The interface "
"records declared cumulative measurements and applies accepted quantities to "
"production moves. Requires configured components, reservations and suitable "
"units; it does not read a connected physical scale itself."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_agreement_competition
msgid ""
"Adds computed market price, comparison scope and percentage gap to agreement"
" lines. Uses the current date, trade direction, company and partner to "
"select eligible recorded offers, with partner, industry and broader market "
"scopes supplied by the competition dependency. Converts prices to the "
"agreement unit and currency. Sales and purchase bridges expose the fields in"
" their forms."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_tender
msgid ""
"Adds concrete purchase tender records, offer links, vendor invitation and "
"comparison actions over the shared tender workflow. Awards can allocate "
"quantities among recorded offers and confirm selected orders. Requires "
"prepared purchase quotations and configured suppliers; no external tender "
"portal is supplied here."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_tender
msgid ""
"Adds concrete sales tender and line models, quotation links and buyer-"
"invitation actions. Uses the shared tender workflow to compare recorded "
"offers and allocate awarded quantities. Requires sales quotation data; "
"buyers are represented by existing contacts and the module does not provide "
"an external bidding marketplace."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_sms
msgid ""
"Adds configurable SMS templates and delivery-confirmation handling to stock "
"transfers. Sending uses the configured SMS service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_custom
msgid ""
"Adds configurable offline payment instructions, including wire-transfer "
"details. Checkout records a pending transaction; this addon does not contact"
" a bank or automatically establish that funds were received."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds configured approver notifications, approve/refuse/change-request "
"actions and a Mini App for pending requests and owner corrections. Resolves "
"decisions to linked internal users and the existing approval records. "
"Requires a configured bot, enabled notification settings and linked user "
"chats; delivery depends on Telegram access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_hr_payroll_account
msgid ""
"Adds contract counts and navigation based on the project payroll accounting "
"relationships."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_peppol_advanced_fields
msgid ""
"Adds contract, project, originator, despatch, additional-document, "
"accounting-cost and delivery-location references to invoice forms. This "
"deprecated addon only stores these fields; it does not implement their "
"Peppol export."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Adds conversion wizards that transfer inquiry details between CRM leads and "
"helpdesk tickets, with customer and team selection. Requires access to the "
"destination workflow; ticket and lead management remain in the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_threed
msgid ""
"Adds coordinates, dimensions, shapes, colors and tags to stock locations. "
"Warehouse and transfer actions open the configured spatial layout; the "
"layout must be entered or imported."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_phone_validation
msgid ""
"Adds country-aware parsing and formatting through phonenumbers, normalized "
"number lookup and blacklist management. Provides phone-aware model helpers "
"and a mail-thread mixin for adopting records; format validation does not "
"establish ownership or reachability of a number, and delivery integrations "
"must apply blacklist rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_skills_slides
msgid ""
"Adds course links and completion displays to employee resumes. The course "
"completion hook creates missing training entries for employees linked "
"through the learner user contact; course enrollment and delivery are "
"supplied by eLearning."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk_slides
msgid ""
"Adds course selections on helpdesk teams and help-center search adaptations "
"for linked courses and lessons. Results follow team content selections and "
"applicable website filters; course authoring and delivery are provided by "
"eLearning."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_agro_partner_scoring
msgid ""
"Adds crop, production-size and campaign-attribute dimensions to partner "
"scoring, with configurable scores and agronomic notes. Reads customer "
"campaigns and plots and refreshes scores through the supplied model hooks. "
"Requires agronomic records and scoring configuration; it extends the shared "
"scoring engine rather than replacing it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_agreement
msgid ""
"Adds customer agreement records and lines linked to sales orders, with "
"agreed quantities, dates, prices and price breaks. Order lines use the "
"agreement pricing helpers and confirmed quantities contribute to agreement "
"usage. Requires configured customer agreements and uses the shared trade-"
"agreement lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_sepa_direct_debit
msgid ""
"Adds customer mandates, mandate validity checks, payment collection batches "
"and XML export for the implemented pain.008 versions. Requires usable "
"mandates, bank details and company creditor information. Exported requests "
"must be submitted to the bank; a generated file or notification does not "
"establish collection."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning_field_service
msgid ""
"Adds customer-linked field visits to planning shifts, with start and "
"completion actions and a workflow for declaring visits. Opens navigation "
"using the customer coordinates or address. Location messages require the "
"geolocation feature and location information supplied by the client; the "
"addon does not continuously track employees."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_board
msgid ""
"Adds dashboard rendering and an action that stores selected views, domains "
"and context in a user-specific customized view. Users can arrange available "
"application views; underlying record permissions still determine the data "
"shown, and source applications provide the reports."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_stock_renting
msgid ""
"Adds date-range availability, preparation time and cart warnings for rental "
"stock products. Stock checks use the website warehouse and configured out-"
"of-stock policy; valid rental dates are required for period-based "
"quantities."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_date_range
msgid ""
"Adds date-range types, named periods, parent relationships, overlap rules "
"and generation settings. Supplies a generation wizard, scheduled range "
"creation and backend domain-editor integration, plus a mixin for model "
"search fields. Consumers configure the relevant date field and period types;"
" periods are not limited to calendar months or years."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_abc_classification_sale_stock
msgid ""
"Adds delivered sale-order lines as a classification data source and supplies"
" their daily demand history to replenishment calculations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_voice_command
msgid ""
"Adds delivery, transfer and receipt completion phrases to the stock transfer"
" form validation buttons. Recognition and command execution come from the "
"voice dependency; stock validation retains its existing checks and any "
"follow-up dialogs."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_control_iot
msgid ""
"Adds device connection fields and picture or measurement widgets to the "
"quality-check decision form. Controls are shown for the corresponding check "
"type; device handling comes from Quality IoT and requires compatible "
"configured hardware."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_iot
msgid ""
"Adds device selection on quality control points and device connection "
"information on checks. Device forms expose linked control points; using "
"measurements or camera input requires compatible configured IoT hardware and"
" the relevant check interface."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_xendit
msgid ""
"Adds direct card payments and redirect checkout for other supported methods "
"and provider-specific transaction-status handling. Implements saved card "
"payment tokens. Requires a configured Xendit merchant account and "
"credentials; available currencies and payment methods depend on the account "
"and integration configuration. Manual capture and refunds are not "
"implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_razorpay
msgid ""
"Adds direct checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Implements saved payment tokens, full capture, cancellation and full or "
"partial refunds. Requires a configured Razorpay merchant account and "
"credentials; available currencies and payment methods depend on the account "
"and integration configuration. Partial capture is not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_authorize
msgid ""
"Adds direct checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Implements saved payment tokens, full capture, cancellation and full "
"refunds. Requires a configured Authorize.Net merchant account and "
"credentials; available currencies and payment methods depend on the account "
"and integration configuration. Partial capture and partial refunds are not "
"implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_paypal
msgid ""
"Adds direct checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured PayPal merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_sign
msgid ""
"Adds document actions and import dialogs for signature templates, completed-"
"document filing and signer access. Requires the Sign workflow and configured"
" document folders; it does not itself provide external signer identity "
"verification."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_account
msgid ""
"Adds document actions for creating accounting entries and bank statements, "
"journal folder synchronization, and accounting report export to Documents. "
"Requires journal and folder configuration and the corresponding accounting "
"access rights."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_hk_hr_payroll_document
msgid ""
"Adds document count buttons and hides save warnings on IR56B, IR56E, IR56F "
"and IR56G forms. This addon contains view adaptations; declaration "
"generation and storage are implemented by the payroll dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_latam_invoice_document
msgid ""
"Adds document-type records, journal settings, invoice numbering, reversal "
"support and report fields. Requires a country localization to provide "
"document types and enable the company document-use hook, which defaults to "
"false. Posting checks enforce configured type and number requirements; "
"electronic submission is supplied by separate integrations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_se_bban
msgid ""
"Adds domestic account recognition and validation, clearing ranges and "
"Swedish payment XML adaptations. Mixed IBAN and domestic-account exports can"
" produce separate files in a ZIP archive. Requires the Swedish localization "
"and ISO 20022 dependencies declared by this addon; bank submission remains "
"external."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_de_pos_res_cert
msgid ""
"Adds draft order-line differences and restaurant frontend handling to the "
"German Fiskaly POS integration. The floor-specific path requires a "
"restaurant floor and a German company using Fiskaly; this extension does not"
" provide an independent signing service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_dropshipping
msgid ""
"Adds dropshipping routes and adapts procurement, purchase and stock-move "
"handling for supplier-to-customer transfers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_trace_expiry
msgid ""
"Adds each product's shelf-life settings (expiration, best-before, removal "
"and alert delays, and the category default) and computes the corresponding "
"dates on its lots and serial numbers. Removal strategies, stock alerts and "
"fresh quantities stay in product_expiry, which depends on this addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_agronomic_docs
msgid ""
"Adds editable label and technical-sheet records, ingredient and "
"recommendation tables, report templates and label-artwork attachments with "
"download records. Uses shared product-document branding and publication "
"helpers. Regulatory fields and printed layouts reflect entered content; "
"authoring and printing do not validate a product registration or certify "
"label compliance."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sign_emsigner
msgid ""
"Adds emSigner (Aadhaar eSign) as a signer-role authentication method through"
" IAP. The signed document is accepted only when its eSign signature "
"verifies, chains to the CCA India 2022 roots and was appended to the exact "
"document sent for that signer's attempt; the certificate's name is recorded "
"as the signer. Requires service access and IAP credits. If the account has "
"fewer than one credit, the implementation permits signing without the "
"additional identification and records signed_without_extra_auth."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_adyen
msgid ""
"Adds embedded payment components and provider-specific transaction-status "
"handling. Implements saved payment tokens, full or partial capture, "
"cancellation and full or partial refunds. Requires a configured Adyen "
"merchant account and credentials; available currencies and payment methods "
"depend on the account and integration configuration. Express checkout is not"
" implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_stripe
msgid ""
"Adds embedded payment elements and provider-specific transaction-status "
"handling. Implements saved payment tokens, full capture, cancellation, full "
"or partial refunds and express checkout. Requires a configured Stripe "
"merchant account and credentials; available currencies and payment methods "
"depend on the account and integration configuration. Partial capture is not "
"implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_fleet_emission
msgid ""
"Adds emission-inspection records and configurable calendars based on vehicle"
" plate digits. Links inspection documents to vehicles and document "
"requirements. Deadlines depend on the calendars maintained in the database; "
"the addon does not verify current legal requirements."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_sign
msgid ""
"Adds employee and contract signature links, request wizards and signature "
"activities in employee plans."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_hr
msgid ""
"Adds employee assignment fields, views and scheduling integration to "
"projects and tasks. Task users combine employee-linked users with direct "
"user assignments; project managers derive from selected employees. "
"Installation backfills employee associations where possible, and subsequent "
"employee user changes update linked assignments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_hr
msgid ""
"Adds employee cashier selection, PIN and barcode handling, cashier "
"attribution and employee sales reporting. A user still opens the POS "
"session; employee availability follows company and configured access lists, "
"with minimal, basic and advanced employee roles."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_attendance_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds employee check-in, checkout and lunch commands with time parsing and "
"attendance fields. Checkout can stop the employee’s active manufacturing "
"work orders, and a scheduled action closes qualifying open attendances at "
"day end. Requires enabled commands and an appropriate linked employee "
"identity."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech_voiceprint
msgid ""
"Adds employee enrollment and revocation endpoints, stored speaker embeddings"
" and threshold-based matching on transcript speakers. Requires the local "
"decoding and inference libraries and a configured model file. Enrollment "
"records consent and matching can leave speakers unidentified; it is not "
"guaranteed identity verification."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_fleet
msgid ""
"Adds employee vehicle counts and navigation, mobility-card fields and an "
"option to release company cars during employee departure."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_appointment_hr
msgid ""
"Adds employee work-interval checks to appointment availability. Applies "
"configured non-flexible employee calendars to eligible staff users; the "
"appointment setting controls whether employee working hours restrict the "
"slots."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_work_entry_enterprise
msgid ""
"Adds employee-grouped Gantt views with availability and progress "
"calculations for work entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_gantt
msgid ""
"Adds employee-specific support and frontend components for timeline views "
"supplied by dependent applications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_social
msgid ""
"Adds event actions for push posts and reminders and connects event "
"registrations to eligible visitor subscriptions. Requires configured website"
" push messaging and recipient subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_booth
msgid ""
"Adds event booth menus, selection pages and contact registration routes. "
"Requested booths must be available, belong to the event and share one "
"category before confirmation. Sales and payment handling require their "
"respective extensions; this addon supplies the website reservation flow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_exhibitor
msgid ""
"Adds exhibitor website pages and event-page presentation using the "
"configured sponsor and exhibitor information."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_repair
msgid ""
"Adds field-service access rules and a stock-reference action that avoids "
"opening repair records for users without repair permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_edi_approval_sale_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds fiscal and non-fiscal tax, RFC, CFDI usage and payment way checks to "
"Telegram sale confirmation messages. Findings are advisory; confirmation "
"keeps the sale order's normal validation and user permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_document
msgid ""
"Adds folder sorting prompts, automation rules, document move and tag tools, "
"and manual or scheduled sorting. Requires configured folder instructions and"
" an available AI model through the AI dependency. Only eligible documents "
"with applicable sorting configuration are processed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_slides_forum
msgid ""
"Adds forum associations and navigation to courses and adapts forum and "
"learner profile views. Requires a configured course forum; course delivery, "
"discussion moderation and membership behavior are supplied by the "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_loyalty_delivery
msgid ""
"Adds free-shipping reward calculation and shipping-aware loyalty thresholds "
"to sales orders. Requires an applicable loyalty program and a delivery line;"
" transport and carrier service costs are not eliminated by the reward."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_geoengine
msgid ""
"Adds geometry and area to Mexican states, municipalities and postal codes, "
"supplies the state boundaries, loads municipality and postal-code geometry "
"prepared with the bundled tools, shows them on geoengine maps, and serves "
"state and municipality boundaries as coverage-simplified GeoJSON (gzip-"
"compressed, cached per version) for web maps. The municipality and postal "
"code catalogues come from l10n_mx_partner. Requires PostGIS."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_geoengine
msgid ""
"Adds geometry field types, spatial domain operators and aggregates, raster "
"and vector layer settings, and an OpenLayers map view with styling and "
"editing controls. Includes trail generation and GeoJSON, Shapefile and "
"GeoPackage import/export wizards. Requires PostGIS and the declared Python "
"geometry libraries; consuming addons define the business records and map "
"layers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_gps_geoengine
msgid ""
"Adds geometry fields, map views, a trail wizard and geofence configuration "
"over device GPS records. Scheduled actions evaluate geofence alerts, client "
"visits and unmapped stops; bus messages update device positions in connected"
" maps. Requires PostGIS, recorded GPS data and configured client areas. "
"Asset and operator dimensions are supplied by a separate bridge."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_timeout
msgid ""
"Adds group-level timeout settings and session checks for password and "
"multifactor reauthentication. The effective limits depend on the user groups"
" and available authentication methods."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds helpdesk chat commands, chatbot ticket-creation steps, conversation "
"links and team live-chat configuration. Requires an enabled team integration"
" and configured chat channel or chatbot flow; it does not provide an "
"independent messaging service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_latam_base
msgid ""
"Adds identification types, generic seed records and contact or portal "
"fields, with company initialization defaults. VAT types use inherited VAT "
"checks; non-VAT identification checks are extension hooks. Country "
"localizations must supply their own types and validation rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_unsplash
msgid ""
"Adds image-picker search and controller helpers for retrieving Unsplash "
"results and saving selected images as attachments. Uses configured access "
"and application keys and sends download notifications through HTTP requests."
" Requires Unsplash service access; image suitability and use rights are not "
"established by the search interface."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_survey
msgid ""
"Adds interview survey selection on jobs, applicant invitation and response "
"actions, and recruitment-specific survey views. Requires a configured "
"survey; question content and scoring are defined through the Survey "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_sa_edi_pos
msgid ""
"Adds invoice QR and EDI status information to point-of-sale orders and "
"supplies POS payment details to Saudi invoice preparation. Prevents opening "
"a Saudi POS session when its ZATCA-enabled invoice journal has not completed"
" onboarding. Invoice signing and submission are handled by the Saudi EDI "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_pl_edi
msgid ""
"Adds invoice XML generation, authenticated KSeF sessions, document "
"submission and receipt retrieval. Supports fetching incoming documents into "
"configured journals. Requires connection credentials and the relevant "
"invoice and journal configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_jo_edi
msgid ""
"Adds invoice XML preparation, submission and storage of returned "
"identifiers, QR information and errors. Requires the configured client "
"identifier, secret, income source and taxpayer settings used by the "
"Jordanian EDI connection."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ke_edi_oscu
msgid ""
"Adds invoice submission information, receipt identifiers, item registration,"
" code synchronization and service notices. Supplies company and branch "
"settings used by the OSCU connection. Requires registration, configured "
"credentials and appropriate product, partner and tax data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_sa_edi
msgid ""
"Adds journal onboarding, invoice XML preparation, signing and submission for"
" the supported ZATCA reporting and clearance workflows. Stores connection "
"certificates and invoice exchange results. Requires configured company and "
"invoice data, onboarding credentials and the certificates obtained through "
"that process."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ca_payment_cpa005
msgid ""
"Adds journal originator settings, transaction codes, bank details and CPA "
"005 export generation. A batch must use one currency, either CAD or USD. "
"Producing the file does not submit payments to a bank or establish "
"settlement."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_dk_fik
msgid ""
"Adds journal reference formats and an editable eight-digit creditor number. "
"Builds payment references from invoice digits with a Luhn check digit and "
"rejects invoice numbers exceeding the format length. Requires selecting the "
"FIK journal format and verifying the creditor number; this addon does not "
"submit payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_landed_costs
msgid ""
"Adds landed-cost documents, split calculations and vendor-bill integration "
"for transfer costs. Eligible moves require FIFO or average costing and a "
"nonzero quantity. Validation checks balanced allocations, updates stock "
"values and creates accounting entries for products with automated valuation;"
" accounts and journals must be configured."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_http_routing
msgid ""
"Adds language-prefix handling, slug converters, frontend translation loading"
" and error-page rendering to HTTP routes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing_crm
msgid ""
"Adds lead and opportunity counts, analysis navigation and mailing statistics"
" based on matching UTM source IDs. Counts include archived leads; "
"attribution reflects stored source links and does not establish that the "
"mailing caused a conversion."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm
msgid ""
"Adds lead and opportunity records, sales stages, conversion and merging "
"actions, activity reporting and configurable team assignment. Calculates "
"automated opportunity probabilities from recorded outcome frequencies. "
"Probability estimates describe the available history and do not guarantee a "
"sale."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing_crm_sms
msgid ""
"Adds lead count to the SMS campaign winner-selection options supplied by the"
" mailing and CRM integrations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_enterprise
msgid ""
"Adds lead map and cohort views and their frontend behavior. Map placement "
"depends on the geographic information available on contacts."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_data_merge_crm
msgid ""
"Adds lead matching rules and connects the deduplication engine with CRM "
"master-record selection and merge methods."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_survey_crm
msgid ""
"Adds lead-generation flags to suggested answers and CRM settings to surveys."
" Completion of supported survey types creates leads for responses selecting "
"a flagged answer, using response and survey values; also connects live-"
"session completion and lead navigation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_appointment_crm
msgid ""
"Adds lead-generation settings and links appointment events to opportunities."
" New leads are created for enabled appointment types with an external "
"attendee and no existing opportunity; eligible existing leads can be reused."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning_holidays
msgid ""
"Adds leave warnings and absence filters for assigned current or future "
"shifts. Schedule-exception changes trigger allocated-hour recomputation for "
"affected shifts; leave requests and approval remain in the Time Off "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_holidays
msgid ""
"Adds leave warnings, absence searching and time-off grouping to task views "
"using the employee leave records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_hr_holidays
msgid ""
"Adds leave-type settings for including intervening non-working days and "
"limiting requests to designated optional holidays. Extends duration "
"calculations and updates affected neighboring leave requests under the "
"configured Indian leave rules; calendar, full-day eligibility and leave "
"state determine when adjustments apply."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_invoice_margin
msgid ""
"Adds line costs, margin amounts, refund-aware signed margins and percentages"
" to sales accounting documents and invoice reporting. Costs are converted to"
" the document currency and unit. The Show Invoice Margin group controls the "
"supplied views; installation leaves historical margin columns empty rather "
"than reconstructing historical product costs."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_repair
msgid ""
"Adds linked-record counts and navigation actions to purchase and repair "
"orders."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track_live
msgid ""
"Adds live-broadcast settings and website components for configured talk "
"videos and chat. The external video stream must be supplied by the event "
"organizer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_group
msgid ""
"Adds mailing groups, members, threaded messages and moderation decisions. "
"Provides subscription and unsubscribe routes and message archives with "
"group-specific access rules. Email distribution uses the mail infrastructure"
" and its configured delivery transport."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_maintenance_stock
msgid ""
"Adds maintenance and return operation types, links transfers to maintenance "
"orders and provides a wizard to send selected lots between locations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger_maintenance
msgid ""
"Adds maintenance plan templates, dated and distance-based plan triggers, "
"serialized asset links and service log values. Uses the Maintenance and "
"Maintenance Stock applications for maintenance orders and transfers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_co_edi_mandate
msgid ""
"Adds mandate principal and product contract fields and incorporates them in "
"the DIAN UBL line export with the corresponding constraints."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_compliance
msgid ""
"Adds mandatory document-type rules, verification records, expiration "
"activities and per-entity coverage reports over Documents. Applicable "
"requirements and validity periods come from configuration and recorded "
"dates. The reported status measures those configured records; it does not "
"certify legal or regulatory compliance."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_iap_enrich
msgid ""
"Adds manual and scheduled enrichment of leads and writes company information"
" returned by the service. Requires service access and available credits; "
"enrichment depends on a matching company."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_accountant
msgid ""
"Adds manufacturing account fields to the inventory valuation settings view. "
"The manufacturing accounting implementation is supplied by its dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_landed_costs
msgid ""
"Adds manufacturing order selection to landed costs and includes their "
"finished stock moves among allocation targets. Byproduct moves without a "
"cost share are excluded; allocation methods and valuation posting are "
"supplied by Stock Landed Costs."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds manufacturing order, work order, work center and product links to "
"planning slots and reporting. Provides work-center schedule actions, "
"manufacturing planning access groups and a cancellation wizard with optional"
" employee notification. Requires Planning and Manufacturing configuration; "
"linked slots do not themselves perform manufacturing scheduling "
"optimization."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_commission_margin
msgid ""
"Adds margin-based achievement types and margin rate handling to commission "
"calculations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_agreement_competition
msgid ""
"Adds market-price, comparison-scope and percentage-gap columns to the "
"agreement line list. The shared trade agreement competition addon computes "
"these values from recorded competitor offers. This addon supplies the "
"purchase agreement view extension; it does not fetch external market prices."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_agreement_competition
msgid ""
"Adds market-price, comparison-scope and percentage-gap columns to the "
"agreement line list. The shared trade agreement competition addon computes "
"these values from recorded competitor offers. This addon supplies the sale "
"agreement view extension; it does not fetch external market prices."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_room
msgid ""
"Adds meeting-room asset details and a tablet-oriented booking page. Projects"
" reservation occupancy from the shared resource engine and sends updates "
"when relevant bookings change. Requires configured room resources and access"
" to the room booking page."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_hr_mobile
msgid ""
"Adds mobile-client barcode handling to the POS employee login integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_mobile
msgid ""
"Adds mobile-specific employee frontend behavior and assets to the backend "
"client."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_gr_edi
msgid ""
"Adds myDATA invoice preparation, transmission, status identifiers and "
"incoming document processing. Supports configured classifications and "
"accounting mappings. Requires AADE connection credentials and appropriate "
"accounting configuration; transmission status is recorded from the service "
"responses."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_mass_mailing
msgid ""
"Adds newsletter settings and a checkout subscription option. When the "
"submitted form includes newsletter consent and an email address, it calls "
"the mailing subscription flow for the website list; it does not send a "
"campaign as part of checkout."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_mass_mailing
msgid ""
"Adds newsletter subscription interfaces and routes that create mailing "
"contacts or restore opted-out list subscriptions. Requires a configured "
"mailing list and website form or snippet; the subscription route applies the"
" configured captcha check. Message delivery is supplied by the mailing "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds one voice-note transcription for every Telegram bot: the note is heard "
"through speech under the company's transcription policy and nothing of it is"
" stored. Also ships the business terms the bots' users say, as speech "
"vocabulary. Requires a usable speech engine; without one a bot tells its "
"user to type instead."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_online_payment
msgid ""
"Adds online initiation, signing and status polling for SEPA credit-transfer "
"batches on payment-enabled bank links. Requires online bank connectivity and"
" provider activation; identity verification may be required. This is an "
"outgoing batch-payment integration, not customer invoice checkout."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_loss_reason
msgid ""
"Adds ordered, archivable loss-reason records, seed data and configuration "
"views. Reasons can be shared or scoped to sales, purchases or tasks and a "
"company. Consumer applications implement document closing, reason selection "
"and reporting."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_holidays_attendance
msgid ""
"Adds overtime-linked leave types and allocations, overtime balance checks "
"and attendance-versus-leave reporting. The relevant leave and accrual "
"settings determine how attendance hours affect entitlements; the addon does "
"not convert every extra hour automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_delivery
msgid ""
"Adds own-fleet, salesperson, third-party and pickup modes to carriers and "
"locations. Carrier mode takes precedence over source-location mode. For "
"configured outgoing dispatch operations, third-party delivery requires a "
"tracking reference; own-fleet and salesperson modes retain the inherited "
"trip requirement."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_dk_nemhandel
msgid ""
"Adds participant registration, contact verification and invoice exchange "
"through the EDI proxy. Builds OIOUBL documents and processes outgoing and "
"incoming documents with scheduled jobs. Requires a registered connection, "
"configured journals and recipient identifiers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_peppol
msgid ""
"Adds participant registration, electronic invoice sending, incoming document"
" retrieval and exchange status handling through the configured EDI proxy. "
"Uses supported document formats, partner identifiers and receiving journals."
" Requires a registered connection and eligible recipients."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_passkey
msgid ""
"Adds passkey registration, credential management and browser login backed by"
" WebAuthn challenge and origin verification. Requires a compatible browser "
"and authenticator and a correctly configured site URL. Successful passkey "
"authentication skips the separate MFA step in this implementation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_account_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds payment and payment-in-kind chat flows with evidence upload, "
"confirmation and request logs. After approval, starts the configured "
"automation when its prerequisites are met, including a required statement "
"link where applicable. Requires configured bot commands, approval categories"
" and accounting workflows; approval alone does not guarantee workflow "
"completion."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_us_check_printing
msgid ""
"Adds payment check and blank-check templates in top, middle and bottom "
"positions, with report data and styling. Requires compatible stationery and "
"printer alignment; the supplied layouts do not guarantee compatibility with "
"every commercial check stock."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_razorpay
msgid ""
"Adds payment initiation, status lookup, cancellation and refund requests "
"through the Razorpay POS integration. Requires merchant credentials, a "
"configured terminal and a company whose currency is INR; available payment "
"instruments depend on the provider and terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_pine_labs
msgid ""
"Adds payment initiation, status polling and cancellation through the Pine "
"Labs integration. Requires a configured merchant account, terminal "
"credentials and a company whose currency is INR; payment instruments and "
"terminal capabilities depend on the provider configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_hr_payroll
msgid ""
"Adds payslip document tags, folder selection, access links and notification "
"or resend actions. Creation checks depend on an employee user or enabled "
"company HR document settings, together with the base document rules. Payroll"
" generation remains in the payroll dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_media
msgid ""
"Adds per-company configuration fields for social account URLs and the "
"company configuration relation. Consumer addons choose where to display or "
"use these links; this module supplies no social network authentication, "
"posting or synchronization client."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_resource_asset
msgid ""
"Adds per-kind, per-company centralization settings, folders and tags, plus "
"asset document links and navigation. Automatic document creation requires "
"centralization to be enabled for the asset kind in its company; kinds "
"without a settings row do not enable it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds per-website channel selection, visitor-to-conversation links, visitor "
"context and chatbot testing pages. The website supplies chat information "
"when a channel is configured; conversation availability and routing depend "
"on live chat rules, operators and chatbot configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_mondialrelay
msgid ""
"Adds pickup-point selection and shipping-address updates for carts using a "
"Mondial Relay carrier. Requires an identified cart customer and a pickup "
"country allowed by the carrier. Checkout checks that the selected carrier "
"and pickup address agree; provider access comes from the delivery "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_work_entry_planning
msgid ""
"Adds planning as a work-entry source and links entries to planning slots. "
"Slot changes update the corresponding work entries subject to validation "
"restrictions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_planning
msgid "Adds planning-slot counts and navigation to payslip forms."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iot_worldline
msgid ""
"Adds platform-specific CTEP interfaces and terminal drivers for Linux and "
"Windows, including transaction and cancellation calls. Requires the matching"
" native vendor library, compatible hardware and IoT runtime. The "
"corresponding POS integration supplies the payment-screen workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_plugin
msgid ""
"Adds plugin authorization, contact search and creation, optional contact "
"enrichment and email-content logging routes. Requires a compatible mailbox "
"plugin and scoped credentials. Base logging accepts contact records; "
"extension addons add other target models, while enrichment depends on the "
"external IAP service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_mail_plugin
msgid ""
"Adds plugin endpoints for contact leads, lead creation and logging email "
"content. Requires the mail-client plugin integration provided by its "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_portal
msgid ""
"Adds portal controls for enabling or disabling two-factor authentication, "
"revoking trusted devices and adding, renaming or deleting passkeys. Uses the"
" authentication dependencies for credential operations; passkey enrollment "
"requires a compatible browser and authenticator."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_payment_provider
msgid ""
"Adds portal invoice payment flows, payment links and transaction tracking. "
"Completed transactions create and reconcile accounting payments; available "
"capture and refund operations depend on the configured provider."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_snailmail_account_followup
msgid ""
"Adds postal delivery to follow-up configuration and generates the follow-up "
"PDF for the mailing service. Requires service access, credits and a usable "
"postal address."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_account
msgid ""
"Adds posting approval bindings, partner and journal flags, company amount "
"thresholds and accounting criteria for approval categories. Ordinary journal"
" entries bypass the invoice approval trigger. Also links request lines to "
"accounting documents and bank statement lines; automatic posting after "
"approval depends on company configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_stock
msgid ""
"Adds product and lot selection, return and replacement actions, and links "
"between tickets and stock transfers. The return wizard selects eligible "
"customer deliveries and carries the ticket reference onto the resulting "
"transfer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_account
msgid ""
"Adds product cost and valuation settings, stock-move values, inventory "
"valuation reports and accounting integration. Supports valuation closing and"
" cost-related journal-line helpers according to configured policies. "
"Requires suitable product, company, journal and account setup; it does not "
"provide a standalone invoice-from-picking workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_product
msgid ""
"Adds product document configuration, counts and navigation. The create-"
"product action creates one product template for the selected documents, "
"links their attachments and uses the first suitable image as its product "
"image; it does not extract a product catalog from file contents."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_compliance_product
msgid ""
"Adds product entities to document requirement reports and product-category "
"restrictions to document types."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_product
msgid ""
"Adds product quantities, units, prices and subtotals to approval requests, "
"plus category criteria and shared document approval helpers. Provides hooks "
"for linked target documents, protected fields and approval snapshots. Sales,"
" purchase and other integration addons supply their specific document "
"bindings and target creation behavior."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_maintenance
msgid ""
"Adds production and work-order references on maintenance orders and derives "
"work-center links from their resources. Work-order actions prefill the "
"production, company and work-center resource; maintenance scheduling and "
"equipment history are supplied by the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_gantt
msgid ""
"Adds project and task Gantt views, resource availability, workload "
"indicators and dependent-task rescheduling, including shared project views."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_report
msgid ""
"Adds project and task worksheet templates, worksheet forms, report rendering"
" and portal report context. Requires worksheets enabled on the project and a"
" task template; report rendering selects the latest worksheet linked to the "
"task."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_project
msgid ""
"Adds project folder configuration, document counts and navigation, and "
"project folder destinations for project and task attachments. Folder "
"creation uses project privacy and company settings, and the addon protects "
"linked project folders from automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds project links to production orders and bills of materials, carries them"
" through procurement and exposes production counts and navigation on "
"projects."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_purchase
msgid ""
"Adds project references to purchase orders, propagates analytic distribution"
" to lines and supplies purchase navigation and profitability entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_forecast
msgid ""
"Adds project selection to planning slots and shift templates, project "
"planned-hour totals, project reporting dimensions and project information on"
" shared schedules. Requires Planning and Project; this addon does not "
"predict project completion dates."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_dashboard_links
msgid ""
"Adds project-card counters and actions for tasks in progress, overdue, due "
"today, due this week and unassigned."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_fields
msgid ""
"Adds prompt and record-domain settings for AI-computed fields and scheduled "
"filling of eligible empty values. Requires a configured AI provider; "
"generated values depend on the prompt and source records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_scraper_wallet
msgid ""
"Adds provider and credential links to wallet accounts and source-run links "
"to balances, statements and transactions. A provider-specific addon supplies"
" the actual portal reader."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_knowledge
msgid ""
"Adds public article rendering, navigation and search routes, plus website "
"metadata. Article access settings determine which content is available to "
"visitors."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event
msgid ""
"Adds public event listings, event pages and registration forms. Paid ticket "
"sales require the website event sales integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_hr_recruitment
msgid ""
"Adds public job listing, detail and application pages linked to recruitment "
"records. Stores website descriptions and publication information on jobs and"
" processes submitted application data. Recruiting teams manage applicants "
"through the recruitment dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_accountant
msgid ""
"Adds purchase-line views, filters and actions for accounting closing and "
"accrual review."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_sale
msgid ""
"Adds quotation and invoice links to field-service tasks and exposes a "
"product catalog for recording task materials on sales orders. Connects task "
"timesheets to sales lines and supports task-related invoicing actions. Uses "
"the sales and timesheet dependencies for billing calculations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing_sale_sms
msgid ""
"Adds quotation count and invoiced revenue to the SMS campaign winner-"
"selection options."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_hr_expense
msgid ""
"Adds receipt-extraction actions and maps merchant, date, amount and currency"
" results to expenses under the addon’s default-value checks. Uses the "
"extraction framework and its installed strategies. Product prediction and "
"catalog-price replacement belong to the separate expense-prediction bridge."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_account_accountant
msgid ""
"Adds reconciliation frontend components and sales-line views for the "
"combined Sales and Accounting workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Adds recurring price displays, plan selection and subscription cart "
"handling. Products need applicable recurring pricing; the cart rejects "
"conflicting subscription plans and requires a customer address for a plan. "
"Recurring invoices and subscription lifecycle actions come from the "
"subscription dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_mercado_pago
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Implements saved payment tokens and OAuth account authorization. Requires a "
"configured Mercado Pago merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_flutterwave
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Implements saving supported payment tokens during payment. Requires a "
"configured Flutterwave merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_worldline
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Implements saving supported payment tokens during payment. Requires a "
"configured Worldline merchant account and credentials; available currencies "
"and payment methods depend on the account and integration configuration. "
"Token-only validation, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_aps
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Amazon Payment Services merchant account and "
"credentials; available currencies and payment methods depend on the account "
"and integration configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are "
"not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_asiapay
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured AsiaPay merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented;"
" the provider currency configuration restricts available payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_buckaroo
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Buckaroo merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_dpo
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured DPO merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_mollie
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Mollie merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_nuvei
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Nuvei merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_paymob
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Paymob merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_redsys
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured Redsys merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_iyzico
msgid ""
"Adds redirect checkout and provider-specific transaction-status handling. "
"Requires a configured iyzico merchant account and credentials; available "
"currencies and payment methods depend on the account and integration "
"configuration. Tokenization, manual capture and refunds are not implemented."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_relationship
msgid ""
"Adds relationship types and dated links between contacts, including inverse "
"labels and relationship attributes. Provides contact relationship views and "
"a path-inspection wizard. Network results reflect recorded links and "
"configured types rather than independently verified personal or commercial "
"relationships."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_relationship_blocklist
msgid ""
"Adds relationship-based blocklist indicators, warnings and an action to "
"inspect connected listed contacts. Traverses the existing relationship graph"
" and uses the stored SAT list classification. This bridge reports proximity;"
" it does not extend invoice refusal to relatives or other related contacts."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_renting
msgid ""
"Adds rentable products, duration-based pricing and rental dates on sales "
"orders. Provides pickup and return quantity actions, rental status and "
"delay-related pricing. Physical inventory transfer integration is supplied "
"by the rental stock addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_stock_renting
msgid ""
"Adds rental stock locations, availability calculations, serial-number "
"reservations and pickup and return operations. Stock-transfer behavior "
"depends on the rental picking configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_repair
msgid ""
"Adds repair order links, counts and a repair-creation action on tickets. "
"Ticket information supplies defaults to the repair form; repair operations "
"are implemented by the Repair dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_esg_csrd_hr
msgid ""
"Adds report variables for employee demographics, employment types, turnover,"
" tenure and pay gaps using the available HR records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_compliance_resource_asset
msgid ""
"Adds resource assets to document requirement reports and asset-kind "
"restrictions to document types."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_restaurant_preparation_display
msgid ""
"Adds restaurant table and course data to preparation orders and adapts order"
" merging and display notifications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_renting_planning
msgid ""
"Adds role settings for rental synchronization and creates or updates "
"planning slots from rental sales lines. Planning slots can create or reuse "
"rental orders."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_sale_timesheet
msgid ""
"Adds sales order item selection, remaining sold hours and invoice navigation"
" to helpdesk tickets. Timesheet billing requires the team time-billing "
"feature and an eligible service sales order item; invoicing uses the sales "
"and timesheet dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_expense
msgid ""
"Adds sales order selection on eligible expenses and creates reinvoice sales "
"lines from expense accounting entries. Product expense policies and the "
"linked sales order determine reinvoicing; expense approval and customer "
"invoice posting remain in their respective workflows."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_dashboard
msgid ""
"Adds sales-analysis graph and pivot views, search filters and a website "
"dashboard redirect for sales users. The action selects sales report rows "
"whose team has a website and defaults to confirmed orders; it does not "
"independently prove that every included order originated online."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_timesheet
msgid ""
"Adds sales-line assignment to timesheets, project pricing configuration, "
"delivered-time quantities and invoice links. Includes employee-to-sales-line"
" mappings, portal timesheet views and date-range invoicing options. Requires"
" billable project and service setup; recorded time contributes according to "
"the applicable invoicing policy."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_sale
msgid ""
"Adds sales-order lookup, settlement and fixed or percentage down payments in"
" POS, with links to originating sales lines and invoice quantities. Also "
"extends sales-team and sales-analysis integration. Down payments require a "
"configured POS down-payment product; invoicing and fulfillment follow the "
"associated order and POS configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_delivery_iot
msgid ""
"Adds scale selection to package preparation and optional automatic printing "
"of carrier labels and export documents. Requires compatible configured "
"scales or printers, printer assignments and operation-type settings; "
"shipping document availability depends on the carrier and destination."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_molecular_screening
msgid ""
"Adds screening campaigns, receptor targets with a redocking validation gate,"
" a compound library keyed on chemical identity with campaign roles, 2D and "
"3D structures, and docking jobs that stay blocked while their target fails "
"validation. Includes a sketch editor and a 3D viewer; formula, masses, "
"rings, aromaticity, hydrogen-bond counts and Gasteiger partial charges are "
"recomputed on the server, and every property keeps the method that produced "
"it. It records docking runs and results but does not run a docking engine, "
"and it perceives no stereochemistry."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_employee_firstname
msgid ""
"Adds separate name components and a configurable name order to employee "
"records, with create and write helpers that compose or split the display "
"name. Supplies employee views and installation initialization for existing "
"names. Name splitting follows configured rules and may require manual "
"correction for names outside those patterns."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iap
msgid ""
"Adds service definitions, credential-backed account tokens, account "
"configuration and remote credit-balance or purchase links, plus service-"
"request helpers. Consumer addons implement their specific paid features; "
"balances and service availability depend on the external IAP endpoint and "
"account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_project
msgid ""
"Adds service-product project and task settings, sales-line links and project"
" creation actions. Supports billable projects and milestone-based delivered "
"quantities alongside related reports and portal extensions. Generation "
"depends on the service tracking policy and configured templates; not every "
"sales order creates a project."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_edi_ubl
msgid ""
"Adds shared UBL order-node construction and import helpers over trade "
"accounting and UBL/CII dependencies. Extends the order mixin with builder "
"selection and uploaded-document decoding hooks. Concrete order integrations "
"supply their direction-specific fields; this addon does not itself transmit "
"documents over Peppol."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_skills
msgid ""
"Adds skill types, levels, employee and job skill assignments, certification "
"validity fields and resume histories. Provides skill reports and printable "
"employee resumes. Recorded proficiency and certification dates are "
"maintained in the database; the addon does not independently verify "
"qualifications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_workorder_expiry
msgid ""
"Adds skip_expired context to the tablet work order finish and manufacturing-"
"order navigation buttons, plus styling for expiration alerts. This addon "
"adapts those interface paths; expiration dates and their validation belong "
"to its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_sale
msgid ""
"Adds social post statistics and navigation using the recorded UTM source. "
"The order count includes matching sales orders regardless of state. The "
"amount aggregates posted product-line balances across invoices, refunds and "
"receipts, including vendor documents, in accessible companies; it is not a "
"measure of sales caused by the post."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_event_social
msgid ""
"Adds social-post templates to event communication scheduling and creates "
"posts for connected template accounts. Social posts cannot use registration-"
"triggered scheduling; account connectivity and publication are provided by "
"the Social dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_booth_exhibitor
msgid ""
"Adds sponsorship settings on booth categories and sponsor details to "
"registration forms. After booth confirmation, a booth with sponsorship "
"enabled and a contact is linked to an existing matching sponsor or a newly "
"created one; other booths do not create sponsors."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_spreadsheet
msgid ""
"Adds spreadsheet document handling, templates, collaboration messages, "
"CSV/XLSX import and spreadsheet sharing controls. Access follows the "
"document and spreadsheet permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_spreadsheet_account
msgid ""
"Adds spreadsheet functions and server queries for debit, credit, residual "
"amounts, partner balances and accounting tags, with fiscal-date helpers and "
"journal-item drilldowns."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_address_extended
msgid ""
"Adds street-name and number fields with synchronization to the street text, "
"a city catalog and country-specific city selection. City data must be "
"configured or supplied by another addon; this module does not provide a "
"complete global address registry."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_subcontracting
msgid ""
"Adds subcontracting bills of materials, supplier locations, resupply routes "
"and production records tied to incoming transfers. Provides subcontractor "
"portal access to the relevant production records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_commission_subscription
msgid ""
"Adds subscription achievement types and recurring-plan filters, using "
"subscription order-log data in commission reporting."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Adds subscription counts and a subscription navigation action to call "
"records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Adds subscription navigation from analytic accounts and projects, "
"subscription items in project profitability, and adaptations to service and "
"recurring-task generation. Requires eligible subscription sales items and "
"project service configuration; recurring billing remains in the subscription"
" dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_appraisal_survey
msgid ""
"Adds survey invitations, linked responses, completion notifications and "
"result access to appraisals. The invitation wizard uses a selected survey "
"template and reachable employee contacts; survey participation and result "
"access follow the configured appraisal and survey workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_slides_survey
msgid ""
"Adds survey-backed certification lessons, attempt links, completion handling"
" and certificate information on learner profiles. Requires configured "
"certification surveys and their scoring rules; passing records the "
"configured course assessment and does not establish external accreditation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track
msgid ""
"Adds talk and speaker records, event agendas, website talk pages and "
"proposal forms. Live streams, quizzes and other presentation features "
"require their corresponding extensions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track_quiz
msgid ""
"Adds talk quiz questions, answers and scoring, with website participation "
"and result displays."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_project
msgid ""
"Adds task analysis and code-generation actions, codebase context selection, "
"workflow states and GitHub pull-request synchronization. Code generation is "
"an agent run on an isolated runner: it clones the project's repository, "
"writes the task's change on a branch of its own, pushes it and opens a pull "
"request, with a GitHub App token for that repository alone and the company's"
" model key only where its data policy allows. Requires a runner, the "
"company's GitHub App and AI service access; generated changes require review"
" and deployment is not automated by the workflow state labels."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_map
msgid ""
"Adds task map views, assignee names and map navigation actions using the "
"geographic data available on the task contacts."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk_knowledge
msgid ""
"Adds team article selection, recent-article displays and article search "
"results to help-center pages. Public visibility follows the article "
"publishing and access settings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk_forum
msgid ""
"Adds team forum configuration, help-center forum search and ticket-to-post "
"or post-to-ticket actions. Requires the corresponding help-center feature "
"and forum access; forum discussions and helpdesk workflow remain in their "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_team
msgid ""
"Adds team usage, assignment fields and views for manufacturing orders, with "
"team-specific access rules and navigation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_team
msgid ""
"Adds team usage, assignment fields and views for purchase orders, with team-"
"specific access rules and navigation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_team
msgid ""
"Adds team usage, assignment fields and views for stock transfers, with team-"
"specific access rules and navigation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Adds team website pages, ticket forms, attachment handling and help-center "
"search hooks. Teams configure website visibility and enabled help content."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_tyro
msgid ""
"Adds terminal pairing, merchant settings, receipt options and surcharge-"
"product configuration to the Tyro POS payment interface. Requires a "
"supported terminal and merchant account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds the /entrega bot command: the driver or salesperson who delivered sends"
" the photo of the delivery slip the customer signed. The bot reads the "
"slip's QR code, or offers the deliveries waiting for it, files the photo as "
"the delivery's signed slip and, when the delivery rides a departed trip of "
"theirs, marks it delivered. Requires a linked Telegram account and the "
"Driver group."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds the /lead command, chatbot lead-creation steps and links between CRM "
"leads and chat conversations. Command-created leads include conversation "
"history and available visitor contact information; chatbot lead creation "
"requires the corresponding configured steps."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_account
msgid ""
"Adds the AI text-draft interface to the invoice-send wizard. Generation uses"
" the configured AI service supplied by the AI integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_sign
msgid ""
"Adds the AI text-draft interface to the signature request composer. Requires"
" the configured AI generation service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_app
msgid ""
"Adds the Approvals application, request categories, manual request forms, "
"templates and document requirements. Checks configured required fields and "
"explicitly assigned attachment requirements at confirmation. Routing and "
"decisions are supplied by the approval engine; categories and approvers "
"determine the workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_pos_sale
msgid ""
"Adds the Belgian intra-community fiscal-position tax mappings to POS "
"configuration data for the sales-order integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner
msgid ""
"Adds the Contacts application menu and directory views over shared contact "
"records. Extends contacts with birth dates, calculated ages and configurable"
" age ranges. Customer and supplier workflows are supplied by their "
"respective business applications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_scraper_efectivale
msgid ""
"Adds the Efectinet portal access mode to the scraper framework. Uses "
"configured account credentials to retrieve card statements and balances and "
"records the source run on imported wallet data. The mobile API mode and "
"wallet funding are in integration_efectivale."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_agro_surface_map
msgid ""
"Adds the Market Map to Agronomy reporting: Mexico drawn by municipality or "
"by state and coloured by the SIAP market value, planted hectares, USD per "
"hectare or pesos, per agrochemical segment, with a ranking, a crop treemap "
"and a detail panel that filter one another; states, municipalities and crops"
" can be picked one at a time or several at once. The market comes from "
"l10n_mx_agro_surface's value-by-zone report, the boundaries from "
"l10n_mx_geoengine. Pesos use a fixed rate per year when the system parameter"
" l10n_mx_agro_surface_map.usd_mxn_rate.<year> holds one, else the day's "
"rate, and are unavailable without one. Other modules add metrics by patching"
" the dashboard, and views next to the 2D map through the "
"l10n_mx_agro_surface_map.renderers registry."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_efectivale
msgid ""
"Adds the Mobile API access mode to Efectivale providers. Reads fuel card "
"balances and recent movements from the mobile backend over HTTP without the "
"Efectinet portal or a browser, and sends administrator allocations for "
"wallet funding requests. Historical statements remain portal-only. Upgrading"
" web_scraper_efectivale to 19.0.2.4.0 marks it for installation on existing "
"databases."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_pase
msgid ""
"Adds the Mobile API access mode to PASE wallet accounts. Scheduled reads log"
" in to the TuTag mobile backend over HTTP with the account's credential and "
"mobile account ID, without the enterprise portal, a browser or a CAPTCHA, "
"and import TAG balances and movements through the PASE import pipeline. "
"Upgrading web_scraper_highway to 19.0.3.5.0 marks it for installation on "
"existing databases."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_sms
msgid ""
"Adds the SMS composer action to CRM lead views. Sending uses the configured "
"SMS service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_address_autocomplete
msgid ""
"Adds the address autocomplete field widget, set on the street of partner and"
" company forms, and the server routes answering its suggestions and the "
"chosen address's details. Lookups go to the installed provider chosen in the"
" settings, with the key that provider keeps for internal users; without a "
"provider the widget suggests nothing."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_partner
msgid ""
"Adds the catalogue of Mexican municipalities (INEGI keys per state) and of "
"postal codes with their settlements, an import of the national SEPOMEX file "
"(cpdescarga.txt, downloaded by each database since its licence forbids "
"redistribution) that links every settlement to its municipality, and "
"municipality and postal code fields on contacts. Other modules read a "
"contact's municipality through one SQL expression: the municipality set on "
"it, else the one of its postal code. Municipalities are not preloaded; they "
"come from a module that supplies them, such as l10n_mx_geoengine with its "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_mobile
msgid ""
"Adds the company-phone device category, the number of its SIM, and its "
"authenticated location upload, storing GPS points. The handset's call log "
"and recordings arrive on the device call routes and become phone calls. "
"Requires a provisioned device and compatible companion client; recording "
"capture and handset permissions belong to that client and its device "
"environment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_document_account
msgid ""
"Adds the document or environment company to AI sorting context and adapts "
"candidate tools and setup prompts for accounting documents."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger_document_compliance_hr
msgid ""
"Adds the employee asset-manager dimension to the asset compliance report "
"using the current custody assignment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_compliance_hr
msgid ""
"Adds the employee entity mapping and access rules used by document "
"compliance reporting. Document types and requirements remain configured in "
"the document framework."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_account
msgid ""
"Adds the extraction mixin to accounting moves with vendor-bill eligibility "
"checks and supplier matching. Exposes extracted line proposals in a review "
"wizard before adding accepted lines to the bill. Requires a usable "
"extraction strategy and source attachment; accounting users remain "
"responsible for products, accounts, taxes and posting."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_map
msgid ""
"Adds the map view type, contact coordinate handling and map-service "
"settings. Uses Mapbox when a token is configured and OpenStreetMap services "
"otherwise; routing requires Mapbox configuration. Mapping depends on usable "
"addresses or coordinates and external service access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_report_isr
msgid ""
"Adds the monthly ISR provisional payment working paper and its summary to "
"the Mexican accounting reports. Income and deductions come from posted, paid"
" (cash-basis) accounting by VAT rate, and a monthly capture holds what the "
"books do not: provisional payments made, PTU paid, withholdings, "
"depreciation and loss amortization. The tax is computed with the RMF Annex 8"
" tariffs accumulated by month, kept as editable tables; a tax amount such as"
" IEPS counts as income only when it posts to an income account, and the "
"report flags VAT taxes exigible on invoice rather than on payment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_bot
msgid ""
"Adds the onboarding bot and its scripted responses to supported messaging "
"interactions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iap_crm
msgid ""
"Adds the reveal identifier field to leads and includes it among fields "
"retained by lead merging."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iot_blackbox_be
msgid ""
"Adds the serial device handler, message framing, receipt-registration "
"actions and response parsing for the supported fiscal data module. Requires "
"compatible hardware and an IoT runtime. The point-of-sale fiscal integration"
" supplies business receipt data; installing this driver is not fiscal "
"certification."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_purchase
msgid ""
"Adds the service-to-purchase product option and hooks for creating and "
"updating linked purchase lines from confirmed sales lines. Exposes cross-"
"document actions and cancellation notifications. Requires suitable vendor "
"and service configuration; ordinary products and services without the option"
" do not use this flow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_integration_website_monster
msgid ""
"Adds the site base URL to the Monster contact payload. When the posting uses"
" the redirect application method, it also supplies the job website URL as "
"CustomApplyOnlineURL; posting and website recruitment behavior come from the"
" dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_phone_call_speech_analysis
msgid ""
"Adds the speech-analysis mixin to phone calls, whatever line carried them: "
"once the recordings filed on an ended call are transcribed, the call gets a "
"summary, topics, commitments, questions and moments. Requires a configured "
"analysis model; a recording a business layer files on another record is "
"analysed there instead."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_scale_delivery
msgid ""
"Adds the sum of received weighing gross weights to transfers and substitutes"
" that measurement in the delivery-slip weight block when that total is "
"nonzero. Falls back to the inherited shipping weight for other transfers. "
"Requires the stock-scale and delivery dependencies and recorded received "
"measurements."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_mail
msgid ""
"Adds the website follow widget, subscription endpoints and follower-status "
"checks. It uses the mail follower mechanism and the record access checks in "
"those endpoints; other addons supply the pages and records where the widget "
"appears."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_collection_telegram
msgid ""
"Adds three bot commands for collectors: /cobro records a customer's cash or "
"check payment against their open invoices on the day it was paid, with a "
"photo of the receipt; /custodia lists the collections the collector still "
"holds; /rendir hands them in to a till or a bank account with the deposit "
"slip, as a remittance the treasury validates. Requires a linked Telegram "
"account, the Collector group and a collection custody journal in the "
"collector's company."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_sale_loyalty
msgid ""
"Adds ticket actions and wizards for issuing loyalty cards, coupon values and"
" validity dates. Requires an applicable loyalty program; generated cards "
"remain linked to the originating ticket."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_account
msgid ""
"Adds ticket links to credit notes and adapts the invoice-reversal wizard to "
"select invoices and sales orders for a ticket. Accounting access and an "
"invoice eligible for reversal are required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_holidays_gantt
msgid ""
"Adds time-off Gantt views and frontend handling for employee leave periods."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_timesheet
msgid ""
"Adds timesheet entries linked to employees, projects, tasks and analytic "
"accounting. Computes task time totals and remaining hours and provides "
"analysis and portal views. Employee cost information comes from the hourly-"
"cost dependency; billing and advanced validation are supplied by integration"
" addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Adds total and open-ticket counts and ticket navigation to call records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_enterprise
msgid ""
"Adds transfer map views, stock-move views and cohort reporting to Inventory,"
" with associated settings and frontend components."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_transifex
msgid ""
"Adds translation links and a code-translation interface using project "
"mappings from addon-path .tx/config files. Requires a configured Transifex "
"project URL, a mapped module and a supported language mapping; the remote "
"project must be accessible to the user. Links do not themselves publish "
"translations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_pe_edi_stock
msgid ""
"Adds transport, vehicle, operator and transfer-reason fields used to prepare"
" electronic delivery guides. Tracks submission tickets, document status and "
"errors on stock transfers. Requires the configured delivery-guide API "
"credentials and complete transfer and transport information."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marin_digest_intelligence
msgid ""
"Adds treasury KPI calculations and scheduled morning and afternoon digests "
"using accounting data. Users configure the included companies, digest "
"recipients and cron times. Comparisons are computed from recorded data; no "
"machine-learning service is used."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ke_edi_oscu_mrp
msgid ""
"Adds validation messages and a send action to manufacturing bills of "
"materials. Uses the Kenyan OSCU stock integration to exchange component "
"information. Requires configured and registered products and an active "
"parent connection."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_resource_asset_vehicle
msgid ""
"Adds vehicle assets with plate, VIN and product-model specifications. "
"Provides driver assignments, handover actions, odometer readings and service"
" and cost records using the shared asset infrastructure. Vehicle details and"
" costs are based on entered records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet
msgid ""
"Adds vehicle capacity, dock and driver assignments to stock batches, with "
"departure and return odometers and trip progress. Extends deliveries with "
"dispatch requirements, delivery-failure handling and, per operation type, "
"the photo of the signed delivery slip required to validate them. Requires "
"stock batch and fleet configuration and recorded operational events; GPS "
"readings are supplied by a separate integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_fiscal_categories_fleet
msgid ""
"Adds vehicle rate history and vehicle grouping to the fiscal category "
"report. Extends deferred-entry preparation with the associated asset."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_crm_livechat
msgid ""
"Adds visitor information during live-chat lead creation and session counts "
"and navigation on leads. Sessions are reached through the associated "
"visitor; this addon does not provide a separate chat service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_voice_command
msgid ""
"Adds voice executors that open the note or message composer on a saved "
"record and append recognized text. Requires an available chatter and voice "
"recognition; the user reviews and sends the draft, while undo restores the "
"previous composer text."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_purchase_stock_inter_company_rules
msgid ""
"Adds warehouse and receipt configuration to intercompany orders and mirrors "
"eligible completed delivery move lines into existing matching receipts when "
"synchronization is enabled. Applies to shared products on outgoing or "
"dropship sales deliveries; matching uses the intercompany purchase reference"
" and product. This synchronization does not validate the receiving transfer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_abc_classification_putaway
msgid ""
"Adds warehouse classification profiles and putaway policies mapping ABC and "
"XYZ levels to destination locations. Policy actions and scheduled processing"
" maintain generated rules, with location ordering for placement. Requires "
"classification data and configured policy lines; this addon defines "
"placement rules rather than physically relocating stock."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iap_mail
msgid ""
"Adds warning thresholds and recipients to IAP accounts, with email templates"
" for status, errors and exhausted credits."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_automation_webhook
msgid ""
"Adds webhook endpoints, request payload access and rule dispatch. Rules can "
"configure inbound credentials, request logging and rate limits; the selected"
" authentication mode controls access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_partner
msgid ""
"Adds website URLs, publication-related contact views and a contact detail "
"route with its page template. Other website addons can reuse these contact "
"pages; the module does not publish the whole address book automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_integration_website
msgid ""
"Adds website application URLs and HTML descriptions to job-board posting "
"forms. An optional generation action sends flattened website job text to the"
" configured OLG service and uses its returned content; service access and "
"request limits apply, and generated copy requires review."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_enterprise
msgid ""
"Adds website editor navigation and appearance controls, configurator entries"
" for appointment and helpdesk addons, and appointment snippet installation "
"entries. An enabled website-generator setting exposes an import setup action"
" that creates a website and installs the generator if needed; imported-site "
"conversion belongs to that addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_crm_partner_assign
msgid ""
"Adds website partner listings, partner assignment fields and a lead-"
"forwarding wizard. Provides portal pages for assigned leads and "
"opportunities and partner activity reporting. Published listings and lead "
"access depend on partner configuration and the assignment workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_profile
msgid ""
"Adds website profile pages, avatar and profile access checks, editable "
"profile fields, gamification displays and email validation links. Visibility"
" follows the configured website profile rules; profile statistics depend on "
"records supplied by participating applications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_mail_group
msgid ""
"Adds website routes and templates for group discussions and subscription "
"management, using the group access and moderation settings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_document
msgid ""
"Adds website selection and access-URL computation to shared documents and "
"folders, with website consistency checks. Selecting a website changes link "
"routing; document sharing permissions remain governed by Documents."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_test_website_sale
msgid ""
"Adds website test tours for localized checkout address forms through the web"
" test asset bundle. Requires the declared country localization and eCommerce"
" modules; these assets support checkout testing rather than adding address-"
"processing features to production checkout."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_payment
msgid ""
"Adds website-specific provider selection, payment-page adaptations, donation"
" transactions and donation notifications. Providers without a website "
"restriction remain eligible across websites subject to the inherited checks;"
" processing requires an enabled compatible provider and its account "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_wishlist
msgid ""
"Adds wishlist records, storefront controls and add, remove and listing "
"routes. Anonymous entries are associated with the browser session and can be"
" merged into the customer wishlist at login; saved items do not reserve "
"stock or guarantee future availability."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_mrp_workorder_worksheet
msgid ""
"Adds worksheet actions and frontend handling to work-order quality checks "
"using configured worksheet templates."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_sale_report
msgid ""
"Adds worksheet template selection to products and propagates the configured "
"worksheet behavior to their field-service project setup."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_control_worksheet
msgid ""
"Adds worksheet templates and form actions to quality checks and integrates "
"worksheet completion with the check wizard. Requires a worksheet template "
"for the quality-check model; custom fields and layout are supplied through "
"the worksheet framework."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_maintenance_worksheet
msgid ""
"Adds worksheet-template selection and worksheet counts to maintenance "
"orders. The worksheet action opens the existing linked worksheet or prepares"
" a new one and requires a selected template for the maintenance-order model."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_fr_hr_holidays
msgid "Adjust French leave durations using a reference leave type"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_sale_project_stock_account
msgid "Adjust project stock-cost selection for sales-linked moves"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ae_pos
msgid ""
"Adjust receipt title visibility according to the order state and whether the"
" customer is a company. Applies to POS orders belonging to a UAE company."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_fr_hr_work_entry_holidays
msgid "Adjust work-entry handling for French part-time leave"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_fsm
msgid ""
"Adjusts field-service project document setup and document counts when "
"Documents and Field Service are combined."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_esg_csrd_hr_fleet
msgid ""
"Adjusts settings visibility and menu filtering when sustainability reporting"
" and employee fleet-emission features are installed together."
msgstr ""

