"Binds each OAuth mail server to its own connection on a vendor's integration"
" service, which authorizes it through the standard OAuth flow and keeps its "
"tokens fresh; the server logs in to SMTP and IMAP with XOAUTH2. A personal "
"server must be authorized by the account it sends as. Vendor addons supply "
"the service, the scope and the server types; installing this infrastructure "
"alone configures no mail account."
