"and category approval flags with company amount and request-rate settings. "
"Links approval request lines to purchase order lines and supplies purchase "
"target creation hooks. The applicable category, flags and thresholds "
"determine when approval is required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_sale
