#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_asset_fuel_charge
msgid ""
"Charges each vehicle operator the fuel used after their scheduled leaving "
"time or on days without a shift, from the vehicle's GPS telemetry, the "
"employee's work calendar and the vehicle's own fuel purchase price. Working "
"hours are never charged; driving before the scheduled entry is charged only "
"when asked. A wizard previews, prints or exports a period and generates one "
"charge per operator, vehicle and week. A charge is sent to the operator, who"
" may dispute it, then confirmed and closed; closing records a fuel recovery "
"on the vehicle. Requires GPS data on the vehicle and a work calendar on the "
"operator."
msgstr ""

