"Computes an informative fiscal depreciation per asset and fiscal year on the"
" depreciation board, restated with the INPC: months of use, the half-month "
"of LISR art. 31 VII and a restatement factor floored at 1 (CFF art. 17-A). "
"Adds the monthly INPC table, preloaded with the official series from 2015-01"
" (later months are entered by hand, never estimated), the fiscal category "
"catalogue with the LISR maximum rates and original-value caps, a Fiscal "
"Depreciation tab on assets, a group-by on the asset list and a Fiscal "
"Depreciation report. It creates no journal entries."
msgstr ""

