"profitability"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_employment_hero
msgid ""
"Connect to Employment Hero and synchronize payroll journal data into "
"accounting. Requires configured service credentials and account mappings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_ldap
msgid ""
"Connect to an LDAP server to check user credentials and map directory "
"attributes. Company LDAP configuration controls the directory search and "
"user-creation behaviour."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_web_mobile
msgid ""
"Connect web-client features to APIs exposed by a compatible mobile host"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_website_livechat
msgid "Connect website visitors to configured live chat channels"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_im_livechat
msgid "Connect website visitors with operators and configured chatbot scripts"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_se_pos
msgid ""
"Connects POS orders to the configured IoT fiscal data module and adds "
"receipt registration and reprint handling. When the fiscal device is "
"enabled, session checks require company registry and VAT identifiers and "
"cash control, and prohibit bill splitting. Requires compatible fiscal "
"hardware."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_quality_control
msgid ""
"Connects barcode picking actions to transfer quality checks, including on-"
"demand checks. Saves the current transfer before opening the quality action "
"and refreshes line data afterwards; quality points, check types and transfer"
" configuration come from the quality dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_booth_sale
msgid ""
"Connects booth registration to sales cart lines and adapts booth quantity "
"and contact handling. Requires sale-enabled booth categories and products; "
"ordering and payment processing are supplied by the event sales and "
"eCommerce dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_booth_sale_exhibitor
msgid ""
"Connects booth sales with exhibitor records and their website presentation "
"when the booth sale and exhibitor integrations are installed together."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_scoring
msgid ""
"Connects contact attribute values to the shared scoring engine, with "
"weighted aggregation, score breakdown records and tier bands. Supplies an "
"initial attribute catalog and partner scorecard. Scores depend on maintained"
" attributes and chosen weights; this addon scores customer records rather "
"than CRM opportunities."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_loyalty
msgid ""
"Connects loyalty programs to sales orders with coupon and reward wizards, "
"reward lines, point tracking and related invoice handling. Requires eligible"
" programs, rules and products configured in the loyalty dependency. This "
"bridge supplies the sales-order workflow; website and point-of-sale "
"interfaces use their own addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_slides
msgid ""
"Connects paid-enrollment courses to products, website purchase controls and "
"sales reporting. Order confirmation adds the order contact to matching "
"courses; course products are limited to one unit in the cart. Checkout and "
"payment processing come from eCommerce, and enrollment follows order "
"confirmation rather than a separate payment check here."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_agro_surface_device_gps_geoengine
msgid ""
"Connects plots with geofence geometry, calculates their area and associates "
"planting dates with campaigns. Includes conversion of existing campaign "
"geofences into plots."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_stock
msgid ""
"Connects purchase lines with stock moves and receipts, adds buy procurement "
"rules and replenishment vendor selection, and supplies receipt matching and "
"purchase delivery metrics."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_product_matrix
msgid ""
"Connects purchase orders to the shared order matrix mixin and adds grid "
"controls and quotation or order report layouts. Requires configurable "
"product variants; nonzero quantity changes are refused when a grid cell "
"matches multiple purchase lines."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_renting
msgid ""
"Connects rental pricing and dates to eCommerce product pages, configurators "
"and carts. Adds rental-period constraints and checkout validation using "
"configured duration and day restrictions. Rental fulfillment uses the parent"
" rental workflow and any installed stock integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_loyalty
msgid ""
"Connects sales loyalty programs to eCommerce carts, coupon activation and "
"reward selection. Adds website eligibility settings, sharing links and "
"wallet top-up handling. Discounts and rewards follow the configured programs"
" and their conditions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_api_stock_scale
msgid ""
"Connects scale stations to stock-scale operations through a configured "
"webhook rule and bearer-authenticated HTTP endpoints. Supplies station and "
"warehouse configuration, cached catalog responses and picking validation "
"calls, with a compatibility route for older station clients. Requires "
"provisioned credentials, webhook configuration and compatible scale-station "
"software; authentication and webhook controls use the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track_live_quiz
msgid ""
"Connects talk quizzes with the live-talk website interface and displays "
"their participation controls in that context."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_stock
msgid ""
"Connects task sales lines to stock moves, material pickup and lot or serial "
"assignment. The delivery flow operates on billable tasks with a sales order "
"and checks quantity-decrease exceptions before completing moves; warehouse, "
"route and tracking configuration determine the stock operations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_contract_salary_payroll
msgid ""
"Connects the salary configurator with payslip calculations and exposes "
"calculated payroll results in the offer. Results depend on configured "
"payroll structures and rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_adyen
msgid ""
"Connects the self-order payment flow to the Adyen POS integration and its "
"payment-status handling. Requires that integration and a configured "
"supported terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_pine_labs
msgid ""
"Connects the self-order payment flow to the Pine Labs POS integration and "
"its payment-status handling. Requires that integration and a configured "
"supported terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_qfpay
msgid ""
"Connects the self-order payment flow to the QFPay POS integration and its "
"payment-status handling. Requires that integration and a configured "
"supported terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_razorpay
msgid ""
"Connects the self-order payment flow to the Razorpay POS integration and its"
" payment-status handling. Requires that integration and a configured "
"supported terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_stripe
msgid ""
"Connects the self-order payment flow to the Stripe POS integration and its "
"payment-status handling. Requires that integration and a configured "
"supported terminal."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_sale
msgid ""
"Connects website event registration forms to sales tickets and shopping "
"carts. Creates attendee information from registration submissions and adds "
"ticket-specific cart and payment checks. Requires configured events, ticket "
"products and the eCommerce payment setup used for paid orders."
msgstr ""

