#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_purchase_inter_company_rules
msgid ""
"Creates a purchase order from a confirmed sales order, or a sales order from"
" a confirmed purchase order, when the receiving company enables that "
"direction. Requires an intercompany user and suitable shared configuration; "
"generated orders can be automatically confirmed by the document-state "
"setting. Invoice generation belongs to the accounting dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_appointment_account_payment
msgid ""
"Creates an intermediate booking and draft invoice when an appointment type "
"requires payment, then converts the booking to an event through the paid-"
"booking flow. Requires a configured booking product and payment provider; "
"pending or failed checkout remains a booking and availability is checked "
"before event creation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_mrp_workorder_account
msgid ""
"Creates and updates analytic entries for recorded work-center productivity "
"and refreshes them when the manufacturing project changes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_base_install_request
msgid ""
"Creates approval requests for module activation and opens the installation "
"dependency review only after approval. Uses the supplied activation category"
" and forbids self-approval in its installation hook. An administrator must "
"explicitly continue installation; the approval decision does not install the"
" module."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_workorder_hr_account
msgid ""
"Creates employee-linked analytic costs for work orders and adds expected and"
" actual employee costs to manufacturing reports."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_timesheet_holidays
msgid ""
"Creates leave-linked time entries using configured company projects and "
"tasks, employee schedules and eligible non-work leave types. Updates or "
"removes linked entries as leave and public-holiday records change; the "
"module also restricts direct edits to generated entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_skills_survey
msgid ""
"Creates or updates certification resume entries after a certification survey"
" is completed successfully. Requires an employee linked through the "
"respondent user contact; the configured certification validity determines "
"the end date. These are internal survey results, not independent "
"accreditation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_track_social
msgid ""
"Creates or updates reminder posts from talk settings and selects visitors "
"subscribed to the relevant tracks. Requires website push messaging and "
"visitor permission."
msgstr ""

