msgid ""
"Extend quantity forecasts on sales lines with product expiration rules. "
"Stock due for removal is excluded from the forecast quantities used by the "
"widget."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_management_renting
msgid ""
"Extend quotation-template product selection for rental orders. Adds the "
"rental template views and menu entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_subscription_external_tax
msgid ""
"Extend recurring invoicing and subscription payment preparation with "
"external tax values. Uses the configured external tax provider for the "
"subscription's fiscal position."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_din5008_sale_renting
msgid ""
"Extend rental documents with the DIN 5008 document layout. Uses the "
"company's configured report presentation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_din5008_repair
msgid ""
"Extend repair orders with document templates for the DIN 5008 layout. Uses "
"the company's report-layout configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_asset
msgid ""
"Extend residual value and depreciation amount calculations for the Indian "
"asset rules. Includes the related checks and board modification values."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger
msgid ""
"Extend resource assets with ledger attributes, tags and service-activity "
"tracking. Links stock lots and their logs to the asset records and "
"synchronizes shared asset attributes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ec_sale
msgid ""
"Extend sales orders and payment methods with Ecuadorian invoicing "
"information. Pass the selected values into generated invoices and the portal"
" payment context."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_it_edi_sale
msgid ""
"Extend sales orders with Italian public-administration invoice information. "
"Copy those values into invoices generated from the orders."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_din5008_sale
msgid ""
"Extend sales orders with document templates for the DIN 5008 layout. Uses "
"the company's report-layout configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_br_edi_sale_fiscal_reform
msgid ""
"Extend sales orders with fiscal-reform goods-operation selection. Supplies "
"that classification to the Brazilian invoice integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_auth_password_policy_signup
msgid ""
"Extend signup configuration with password-policy requirements. Provides "
"frontend assets and translations for password entry guidance."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_spreadsheet_edition
msgid ""
"Extend spreadsheet records with collaborative messages, revisions and "
"snapshots. Adds cell discussion threads and spreadsheet download routes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_subcontracting_quality
msgid ""
"Extend stock move line quality-check cleanup for subcontracting. Uses the "
"manufacturing subcontracting and quality-control flows supplied by its "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_stock
msgid ""
"Extend stock transfer printing with localized product prices, taxes and "
"fiscal-position information. Determine invoice partners and document "
"requirements from the transfer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_din5008_stock
msgid ""
"Extend stock transfers with document templates for the DIN 5008 layout. Uses"
" the company's report-layout configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_subscription_partnership
msgid ""
"Extend subscription state changes with partnership activation and removal. "
"Keeps membership status aligned with the associated subscription lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_tender_sale
msgid ""
"Extend tender offer line preparation with the sales order line being served."
" Preserves the commercial link when producing vendor offers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_pl_reports_pos_jpk
msgid ""
"Extend the Polish JPK report query with Point of Sale information. Uses the "
"existing accounting report and POS data models."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_es_reports_2024
msgid ""
"Extend the Spanish report data with the supplied rectification entries. Uses"
" the Modelo 303 accounting report defined by the Spanish reporting "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_hr_recruitment
msgid ""
"Extend the applicant refusal wizard view with AI message assistance. Uses "
"the AI and recruitment features declared by the module."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_gcc_invoice_stock_account
msgid ""
"Extend the bilingual invoice template with product, quantity and serial/lot "
"column labels. Uses the invoice layout's selected display languages."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_digest_enterprise
msgid ""
"Extend the digest configuration through the supplied data records. Metric "
"computation and email delivery are provided by the digest applications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing_event_track_sms
msgid ""
"Extend the event speaker mailing action with SMS campaigns. Uses the "
"selected event speakers and the configured SMS service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_subcontracting_account
msgid ""
"Extend the finished-product cost update and accounting line valuation for "
"subcontracted manufacturing. Uses the stock valuation and subcontracting "
"workflows."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_event_crm
msgid ""
"Extend the lead description and preparation values from website event "
"registration information. Uses the event lead-generation rules supplied by "
"its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_avatax_geolocalize
msgid ""
"Extend the partner address validation wizard with geolocation values. "
"Applies the validated address information when the user saves the result."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_enterprise_hr_skills
msgid ""
"Extend the project scheduling user search with employees whose current "
"skills match the selected task skill filter. Uses employee skill records to "
"resolve candidate users."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_resource_mail
msgid ""
"Extend the resource model with avatar-card data for messaging interfaces. "
"Uses the linked resource information instead of requiring a user record."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_quality_control_picking_batch
msgid ""
"Extend the stock picking batch fields returned to the barcode client. Uses "
"the batch quality controls supplied by the dependent modules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_tax_python
msgid ""
"Extend the tax fields loaded into the POS and its tax computation assets. "
"Uses the custom tax definitions from the Python-tax dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_fleet
msgid ""
"Extend vehicle and employee payroll data with benefit-in-kind and CO2 "
"calculations. Provides salary-rule parameters and links for company-car "
"assignment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_website_enterprise
msgid "Extend website navigation, editor controls and optional feature setup"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ar_website_sale
msgid ""
"Extend website price computation and product templates with Argentine tax "
"display options. Website settings control whether both price presentations "
"are shown."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_crm_iap_reveal_enterprise
msgid ""
"Extends CRM lead views with information supplied by website visitor "
"identification and lead generation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_purchase_stock
msgid ""
"Extends Indian stock and accounting helpers with purchase-order information."
" A bill uses the purchase-linked warehouse address only when its lines "
"resolve to one warehouse contact; otherwise the inherited address is "
"retained. Also supplies purchase-linked fiscal position, dropship "
"destination and stock price or tax values."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_sale_stock
msgid ""
"Extends Indian stock and accounting helpers with sales-order information. An"
" invoice uses the sales-linked warehouse address only when its lines resolve"
" to one warehouse contact; otherwise the inherited address is retained. "
"Sales links also supply stock price, tax, fiscal position and invoice-"
"partner context."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_reports_closing
msgid ""
"Extends Mexican trial-balance reporting with closing-period handling and the"
" corresponding report configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_my_edi_pos
msgid ""
"Extends MyInvois document preparation with point-of-sale orders, refund "
"information and links between orders and consolidated documents. Uses the "
"Malaysian EDI integration for document exchange and requires its configured "
"connection."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_dk_nemhandel_response
msgid ""
"Extends Nemhandel document exchange with response records and actions for "
"accepting or rejecting received documents. Requires the Nemhandel connection"
" and counterpart support for document responses."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_sale_stock_renting
msgid ""
"Extends POS order processing and rental sale-line transferred quantities "
"when rental stock operations are enabled."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_es_edi_verifactu_pos
msgid ""
"Extends POS order processing with VeriFactu document creation, status, "
"refund reasons and receipt QR codes. Uses the company configuration and "
"submission service of the invoice integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_mrp
msgid ""
"Extends POS stock-move selection and Anglo-Saxon unit-cost calculation for "
"manufactured products."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_restaurant
msgid ""
"Extends Point of Sale with floors, tables, guest counts and course records. "
"Adds restaurant screens and configurable bill printing, splitting and tip "
"handling. Printing requires a suitable printer connection and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_appointment_crm
msgid ""
"Extends appointment lead values with the current visitor link and missing "
"country or language values. It applies only when the visitor has no contact "
"or its contact matches the appointment partner; lead generation itself comes"
" from Appointment CRM."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_hr
msgid ""
"Extends approval categories and requests with requester-manager steps, "
"employee manager chains and department access settings. Resolution uses an "
"employee in the request company and a suitable active manager user. "
"Required-manager and minimum-approver checks run when submitting a request; "
"employee and user relationships must be configured."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_automation_account
msgid ""
"Extends automation runs with bank statement context and with workflow step "
"types that create a document from a template, register and reconcile the "
"run's statement line and apply a credit note to open invoices; each document"
" step names its template, company, partner, date and taxes on its own form, "
"and a step that works on an earlier document names the step that made it. "
"The same operations stay available as helpers for Python steps. A collection"
" banked by another company is settled through an intercompany journal each "
"company sets. A run reports what its remaining declared steps are missing, "
"and the wizard that starts a workflow from a statement line previews what "
"each declared step will create. Requires suitable templates; this addon "
"supplies accounting operations to the shared automation runtime."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_delivery_stock_picking_batch
msgid ""
"Extends batch grouping and automatic merge criteria with carrier and weight "
"information. Operation-type configuration controls grouping and maximum "
"weight; carrier execution and transfer batching are implemented by the "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_calendar_gantt_hr
msgid "Extends calendar Gantt unavailability with employee working schedules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_voip_hr
msgid ""
"Extends call participant company matching using employee records and "
"supplies the required access entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_asset_fleet
msgid ""
"Extends depreciation move preparation and asset-log amount calculation when "
"fleet assets carry depreciation boards."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_gps
msgid ""
"Extends devices with position history, fuel, speed, odometer and other "
"telemetry fields, ingestion helpers and tracking reports. Uses configured "
"mappings and validation thresholds and accepts tracker uploads through its "
"controller. Requires a compatible data source and device transport; maps and"
" geofences are provided by the separate geospatial addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_gelato
msgid ""
"Extends eCommerce with Gelato-specific checks. Refuses publication when "
"configured print images are missing and refuses clearing print-image data on"
" a published product. Unpublishes a product when template synchronization "
"increases its image count, copies the template description to the eCommerce "
"description, and blocks cart updates that mix Gelato and other non-service "
"products. Marks the existing Gelato standard and express carriers as "
"published. Requires the Gelato sales integration; this addon does not "
"publish products automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_work_entry_planning_attendance
msgid ""
"Extends employee schedule selection and interval preparation when planning "
"and attendance sources are installed together."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_asset_fuel_charge_wallet
msgid ""
"Extends fuel-charge reports with refuel quantities and amounts from the "
"asset’s wallet card. Uses recent transaction amounts and litres to derive a "
"per-litre price, with the inherited asset-log and fuel-type fallbacks. "
"Requires imported wallet transactions and the asset-card link; this bridge "
"does not download issuer transactions itself."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_msds_compliance
msgid ""
"Extends generated safety-sheet, label and technical-sheet document values "
"with a configured document type and issue date. Sets an expiration date when"
" the type enables expiration and specifies validity days. The document-"
"compliance dependency supplies expiration tracking; validity periods must be"
" configured for the deployment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_pl_edi_jst
msgid ""
"Extends invoice XML values and the FA(3) template when the commercial "
"partner has a configured parent local government unit. Uses the parent as "
"buyer and adds the subordinate recipient details and JST marker; invoice "
"generation and KSeF submission remain in the Polish EDI dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_mrp_stock_landed_costs
msgid ""
"Extends landed-cost journal-item preparation for manufacturing moves "
"associated with projects."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_stock_landed_costs
msgid ""
"Extends landed-cost journal-item preparation with the project analytic "
"distribution of the related stock movement."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_hr_holidays
msgid ""
"Extends leave records with the Documents mixin, employee contact ownership "
"context and employee view access. Document creation requires the company HR "
"document setting and the base mixin creation checks."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_fr_hr_work_entry_holidays
msgid ""
"Extends leave work-entry preparation and excludes the applicable French "
"part-time entries from outside-schedule conflict marking."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_maintenance
msgid ""
"Extends maintenance orders with a request-creation action and a formatted "
"reason containing equipment, products, subject, duration and vendor when "
"present. Uses the inherited approval category and eligibility checks and "
"links the created request back to its order. Approval execution and "
"maintenance workflows come from the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_ledger_maintenance_gps
msgid ""
"Extends maintenance-plan odometer calculation with the GPS reading from the "
"asset stock lot. The fallback applies only when the normal calculation "
"yields no current odometer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_workorder
msgid ""
"Extends manufacturing with work-order planning views, shop-floor interaction"
" and employee session tracking. Connects work orders to quality checks, "
"instructions, components and production completion actions. Available "
"operations depend on configured manufacturing orders, work centers and "
"quality points."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_purchase_stock
msgid ""
"Extends order navigation, procurement line links, destination-address "
"handling and stock-move preparation across sales and purchasing. Uses stock "
"references and configured procurement routes, including make-to-order and "
"dropship flows; procurement creation and route execution come from the "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Extends paid POS order processing and subscription invoiced-quantity "
"calculation for linked sales lines."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_mx_edi_payslip
msgid ""
"Extends payroll with Mexican employee and employer attributes, salary-rule "
"classifications, payslip XML generation, signing and cancellation flows. "
"Includes payroll settings and reporting helpers for overtime, loans and "
"social-insurance data. Requires configured payroll structures, current "
"parameters, certificates and a supported PAC account; generated documents "
"and reports depend on the accuracy of those inputs."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_account
msgid ""
"Extends profitability for projects with an analytic account using eligible "
"vendor bills and refunds, plus analytic entries without journal-item links. "
"Separates other costs and revenues and provides accounting drill-downs where"
" user access permits; amounts depend on the entries and analytic allocation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_renting_project
msgid ""
"Extends project sales-order domains and actions and adds the associated "
"rental sales view integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_databases
msgid ""
"Extends projects with database connection details, synchronization actions "
"and remote user-management tools. Reads supported remote information through"
" authenticated API calls. Requires reachable compatible databases and "
"credentials with the permissions needed for each operation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_tender_stock
msgid ""
"Extends purchase tender offer preparation with the stock destination and "
"procurement links supplied by the inventory integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_control
msgid ""
"Extends quality points with test frequency, sampling and measurement "
"settings. Creates and tracks quality checks on stock operations and provides"
" check-decision wizards and spreadsheet templates. Manufacturing-specific "
"checks require the corresponding integration; recorded results do not "
"independently certify product quality."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_hr_expense_predict
msgid ""
"Extends receipt extraction with the expense product predictor when the "
"expense name is untouched and its product is empty or still the default. If "
"a product is predicted, its nonzero company cost replaces the extracted "
"expense amount. Requires prior expense data for prediction; it does not "
"overwrite an expense with a non-default product."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_event_sale
msgid ""
"Extends registration-state calculation when both sales-order and POS ticket "
"integrations are installed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale_renting_planning
msgid ""
"Extends rental availability for service products with planning enabled and a"
" role whose resources synchronize rental shifts. Counts existing shifts and "
"unavailable work intervals for human resources; products outside these "
"conditions retain the inherited availability flow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_restaurant_loyalty
msgid ""
"Extends restaurant POS order handling to recompute rewards after a table is "
"selected. When an order has courses, newly generated reward lines receive "
"its last course; loyalty programs are configured in the dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_restaurant_adyen
msgid ""
"Extends restaurant payment handling with Adyen tip updates, capture requests"
" and payment notifications. Requires the Adyen terminal configuration and "
"merchant account."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_contract_salary_holidays
msgid ""
"Extends salary-offer signature processing with the configured extra leave "
"allocation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Extends sales orders with subscription plans, recurring pricing, billing "
"dates, renewals and closure reasons. Includes scheduled invoicing, portal "
"actions and subscription reporting. Automatic payment collection requires a "
"compatible configured payment provider and usable payment authorization."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_timesheet_enterprise
msgid ""
"Extends sales timesheet quantities and invoiced-line selection with an "
"optional validated-only filter; the default includes all otherwise eligible "
"timesheets. Adds billing targets, ranking, project-sharing displays and "
"invoicing controls alongside the timesheet grid dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_timesheet_margin
msgid ""
"Extends sales-line purchase-price calculation with costs recorded by the "
"sales timesheet integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_purchase_project
msgid ""
"Extends service-purchase order and line preparation from sales lines with "
"their project information."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_team
msgid ""
"Extends shared teams with sales usage, invoice targets, dashboard actions "
"and sales-order links. Adds team fields to orders, accounting documents, "
"users and sales reports. Requires the Sales and Teams dependencies; CRM-"
"specific functionality is supplied by its own integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_mrp
msgid ""
"Extends stock-enabled order lines with phantom bill-of-materials lookup and "
"component-based delivered or received quantities. Uses the applicable order "
"direction, completed moves and unit conversion, with separate dropship and "
"missing-bill-of-materials handling. Requires configured kit products and "
"adopting stock order models."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_online_payment_self_order_preparation_display
msgid ""
"Extends successful POS online-payment processing to pass paid self-orders "
"into preparation-display handling."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_appointment_sale_project
msgid ""
"Extends task generation from appointment-linked sales lines with the "
"calendar event reference and appointment dates. Adds task navigation to the "
"appointment; requires a sales product configured to generate project work."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_collection_sale_telegram
msgid ""
"Extends the /cobro bot command: next to the customer's open invoices it "
"offers their confirmed cash sales not yet invoiced. Choosing one invoices "
"the order, issues the invoice and records the payment in the collector's "
"custody, as the cash-sale dialog does in the back office."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ar_reports_simple
msgid ""
"Extends the Argentine VAT report with IVA Simple export generation and ARCA "
"activity configuration. Builds purchase and sales data from accounting "
"records and report options. The addon generates files for subsequent "
"processing; it does not submit returns to the authority."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_enterprise_partner_assign
msgid ""
"Extends the CRM lead views with the reseller-assignment fields supplied by "
"the partner assignment integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ke_edi_oscu_stock
msgid ""
"Extends the Kenyan OSCU integration with stock movement reporting, stock-"
"master updates and customs-import records. Adds purchase and sales links for"
" supported document flows and stores exchange errors and identifiers. "
"Requires the parent OSCU connection and configured stock and product data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_integration_skills_monster
msgid ""
"Extends the Monster posting wizard to add JobSkills entries from the job "
"skill records when present. Posting transport and credentials are supplied "
"by the Monster integration; this addon does not discover or assess candidate"
" skills."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_sale_margin
msgid ""
"Extends the POS contribution to Sales Analysis with the sum of POS line "
"margins converted through the report currency rates. POS order processing "
"and sales margin fields are supplied by the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_event_iot
msgid ""
"Extends the POS receipt screen with event badge printing and loads the event"
" badge format into POS data. Printing attendee badges updates attendance; a "
"configured report and compatible IoT printer are required for device output."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_expense_stripe_demo
msgid ""
"Extends the Stripe expense-card integration with test purchase, simulated "
"funding and shipping-status wizards. Supplies test-account setup behavior "
"for demonstrations. Requires the parent integration and its test connection;"
" simulated operations do not represent live card transactions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_barcode_voice_command
msgid ""
"Extends the barcode interface with quantity commands, readback and undo, "
"including inventory-count usage. Transfer validation uses an explicit "
"confirmation flow. Requires an available recognition engine through the "
"voice dependency, microphone access and device speech synthesis for spoken "
"feedback; recognized values still need operator review."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Extends the default mailing domain for sales orders to support subscription "
"targeting."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_project_stock_account
msgid ""
"Extends the domain of stock moves considered for project analytic costing "
"when sales and project inventory accounting are combined."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_employee_second_lastname
msgid ""
"Extends the employee first-name addon with an optional second surname, form "
"fields and name parsing and composition helpers. Initializes existing "
"employee name components through its installation hook. The first-name and "
"primary-surname requirements remain those of the underlying name addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_holidays_homeworking
msgid ""
"Extends the employee presence calculation and frontend presence display when"
" time off and homeworking are installed together."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_be_hr_payroll_attendance
msgid ""
"Extends the employee-version work-hour preparation used by Belgian payroll "
"with split-half hour calculations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_account_purchase
msgid ""
"Extends the invoice extraction schema with a purchase-order reference and "
"passes extracted reference tokens, partner and total to the accounting "
"purchase-matching routine. Runs only for vendor bills without invoice lines "
"after extraction updates; matching behavior comes from the purchase "
"dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_stock_account
msgid ""
"Extends the invoice reversal wizard with product, lot and suitable-order "
"filters for helpdesk stock and accounting flows."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_mrp_workorder_iot
msgid ""
"Extends the manufacturing quality-check interface to request a device "
"measurement and write its returned value to the check. Also adds pass, fail "
"and take-measure action choices to IoT triggers. Measurement capture "
"requires a configured IoT box and device identifier."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_subcontracting_account_enterprise
msgid ""
"Extends the manufacturing report with total and per-unit subcontracting "
"costs derived from linked subcontracting stock moves. Includes these amounts"
" in reported total production cost, with report currency conversion and "
"byproduct cost allocation for the per-unit measure."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_industry_fsm_sale_subscription
msgid ""
"Extends the material action on field-service tasks when subscription sales "
"are installed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_restaurant_stripe
msgid ""
"Extends the restaurant POS frontend for Stripe tipping. Requires a "
"configured Stripe terminal payment method."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_lt_saft_import
msgid ""
"Extends the shared SAF-T importer for LT companies with local account-type "
"mappings, AccountTableID handling, placeholder customer handling and the "
"Transactions container. The shared dependency performs accounting record "
"creation; this is not a tax-filing service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_es_sale_amazon
msgid ""
"Extends the simplified-invoice calculation when the Spanish localization and"
" Amazon sales integration are installed together."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_helpdesk_sale_loyalty
msgid ""
"Extends the ticket coupon wizard to create a loyalty card for the ticket "
"contact using the selected program, points and expiry date, then opens the "
"program share action. Requires an applicable website loyalty program; "
"redemption is handled by the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_fsm_sale
msgid ""
"Extends the ticket task-creation wizard to copy sale_line_id when the source"
" ticket has one. Sales billing and field service workflows are supplied by "
"the dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_fsm_report
msgid ""
"Extends the ticket task-creation wizard with a worksheet template defaulted "
"from the selected project. The chosen template is copied to the generated "
"task when that project allows worksheets."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_timesheet_grid
msgid ""
"Extends timesheet records with validation status, manager actions, grid "
"views and timers. Adds configurable entry and validation reminders and time-"
"rounding settings. Uses the underlying timesheet and project records for "
"employee time and cost information."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_whatsapp_stock
msgid ""
"Extends transfer confirmation handling to queue messages through the "
"configured stock WhatsApp template. Requires outgoing operation type, "
"enabled company WhatsApp confirmation and a selected template; incoming and "
"internal transfers do not use this path."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_crm_sms
msgid ""
"Extends visitor SMS eligibility to leads whose recorded phone numbers match "
"the visitor mobile number. When no contact is linked, it selects the "
"matching lead with the highest confidence for the composer; sending uses the"
" SMS dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_generator_sale
msgid ""
"Extends website conversion requests with the product-import option and "
"creates products, images, attributes and public categories from returned "
"product data. Created products are published on the target website. Coverage"
" depends on the external generator payload; this is not ongoing catalog "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_crm
msgid ""
"Extends website form handling with CRM lead creation, website team and "
"salesperson defaults, and visitor links. Includes contact-input processing "
"for submitted leads. Forms must be configured to target CRM records; "
"installing the addon does not convert every website form into a lead form."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_work_entry_holidays_enterprise
msgid ""
"Extends work entry forms with linked leave information and buttons to "
"approve or refuse the leave behind a conflict. Adds leave-type display on "
"work entry types; leave workflow methods belong to the dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk_holidays
msgid ""
"Extends working-user interval calculation with employee leave intervals when"
" leave computation is requested. Adds the time-off integration to helpdesk "
"team configuration; it does not manage leave approval."
msgstr ""

