" a call from the softphone, the phone system or a company handset is "
"analysed, and its business actions proposed, the same way. The conversation "
"names the call's contact, responsible user, number and the name the line "
"knew the contact by, and follows the call when a late call-log entry "
"completes it."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
