"a company employee folder and HR document settings are enabled. Also hides "
"save warnings on the Belgian 281.10, 281.45 and individual account views; "
"declaration generation belongs to the payroll dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_invoice_receipt_telegram
msgid ""
"Files the photos and PDFs a chat sends after /subirfactura. The posted "
"customer invoice is found only by exact equality on the fiscal folio (SAT "
"UUID) the file carries, read from its SAT QR code, its text layer or local "
"OCR, or an AI model; a typed invoice number never finds one. A file on which"
" no fiscal folio is legible, or whose fiscal folios name no single posted "
"customer invoice, is refused with the reason. A filed scan is stored in the "
"company's Signed Invoices folder, where every salesperson of the company "
"files, with its author, capture date and device (a PDF keeps the file sent "
"as its previous version), linked to the invoice and added to the chat's "
"delivery list, which /terminar hands to administration; the model also reads"
" who signed it as received. Requires a configured Telegram bot, CFDI-stamped"
" invoices, a Signed Invoices folder on the company (made at install for "
"every company with a credit folder) and, for the model read, an AI provider "
"key."
msgstr ""

