#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_trace
msgid ""
"Gives each vehicle a stock location so the goods of a trip are on the "
"vehicle while it travels. Loading moves them there, every stop records what "
"the customer took and what was rejected with its reason, route incidents "
"(spill, damage, theft, breakdown, relief driver, fuel) are recorded and, "
"once approved, move stock, a breakdown hands the load to another vehicle, "
"and the return creates the unloading the warehouse confirms. Each trip keeps"
" a tamper-evident log of checkpoints and a balance of loaded, delivered, "
"returned and written-off quantities per product and lot. Requires dispatch "
"trips from stock_fleet."
msgstr ""

