#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_automation_telegram
msgid ""
"Lets a workflow step send a message through a Telegram bot and wait for the "
"person's answer: a text, a photo, a file, a voice note, a contact or a "
"location. The answer is the event its On Event edge waits for, so a Without "
"Event edge is the reminder or the timeout. Files are kept on the run and the"
" answer becomes the asking step's output. Requires a private chat between "
"the person and the bot."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_insight_telegram
msgid ""
"Lets members of a group ask a Telegram bot questions about Odoo data in "
"their own words, as text or voice notes. A chat model only routes each "
"question to a catalogued report and extracts its parameters; the report "
"reads the database on a read-only transaction that sees every company, so "
"every figure comes from Odoo. Questions no report answers are declined and "
"logged. Requires a bot with questions enabled, a company policy allowing the"
" telegram.insight purpose on a chat model and, for voice notes, a "
"transcription policy."
msgstr ""

