"incident that run works for, by the branch -- never by matching error "
"signatures. The incident's chatter hears when the pull request opens, its "
"checks pass or fail, and it is merged or closed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_expense
