"Links bank journals to accounts available through the online synchronization"
" service. Provides transaction fetching, consent renewal and duplicate-"
"review tools. Requires a supported institution, an authorized connection and"
" continued service access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_event_booth_sale
msgid ""
"Links booth registrations to sales lines and requires booth selection before"
" confirming lines configured for booth service tracking. Updates booth "
"reservations on order confirmation and marks linked booths paid through the "
"invoice payment hook; requires configured booth products and categories."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_repair
msgid ""
"Links checks and alerts to repairs and creates checks from applicable "
"quality control points during repair processing. Check selection depends on "
"the repair product and operation type; completing checks records inspection "
"outcomes rather than guaranteeing repaired-product quality."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality_control_picking_batch
msgid ""
"Links checks to transfer batches, shows pending checks on batches and adapts"
" check handling when transfers are split into waves."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase_competition
msgid ""
"Links competitor offers to purchase orders and adds vendor-oriented market "
"price, price-gap and recommended-price fields. Applies configured resale-"
"margin and overbid parameters through the shared competition helpers. "
"Requires maintained competitor offers and product pricing inputs; "
"recommendations are calculations from those records."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_competition
msgid ""
"Links competitor offers to sales quotations and exposes market-price, gap, "
"margin-floor and recommended-price calculations. Uses configurable margin "
"and undercut settings and the shared loss and activity helpers. The "
"comparison depends on recorded offers and costs; this addon does not obtain "
"competitor pricing automatically."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_resource
msgid ""
"Links endpoints to the material resources they represent, without creating "
"or owning resource identities. Several endpoints can represent one resource."
" Endpoint structure and observation targets remain separate from physical "
"resource containment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning_field_service_stock_fleet
msgid ""
"Links outgoing deliveries by the visit user, customer hierarchy and "
"permitted companies, including carried goods and deliveries completed on the"
" visit day. Signing in or completing a visit refreshes links. Completion "
"refuses unresolved linked deliveries whose trip has departed until they are "
"marked delivered or not delivered."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_timesheet_forecast
msgid ""
"Links planning shifts to timesheets for the same employee and project within"
" the shift date range and adds comparison reports. Matching uses timesheet "
"dates, not clock-time overlap; results depend on recorded timesheets and "
"reporting access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_pricer
msgid ""
