#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_base
msgid ""
"Provide the core registry, users, companies and module-management models"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_default
msgid "Provide the default theme choice for website creation"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_external_tax
msgid ""
"Provide the invoice tax-calculation interface used by external tax "
"connectors. Handles calculation, commitment and cancellation hooks; provider"
" modules implement the service calls."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order_sale
msgid ""
"Provide the kiosk sales team and extend the POS kiosk settings onchange. "
"Connects self-order configuration with the sales-team setup."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_website_partner
msgid "Provide website publication fields and detail pages for contacts"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_dav_sync
msgid ""
"Provides DAV discovery, collection and resource endpoints with vCard and "
"iCalendar conversion for contacts and events. Adds device authentication "
"settings, collection scopes, synchronization state and conflict-handling "
"strategies. Requires provisioned user credentials and enabled device "
"profiles; protocol endpoints do not establish compatibility certification "
"for every DAV client."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_esg_csrd
msgid ""
"Provides ESRS topic records, impact and financial materiality scoring, "
"stakeholder surveys and Knowledge-based report templates. Report "
"completeness and applicability require user review."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_dk_oioubl
msgid ""
"Provides OIOUBL invoice XML generation and import decoding for Danish "
"accounting. Uses invoice, tax and partner information recorded in Odoo. "
"Network registration and document delivery are supplied by exchange addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_point_of_sale
msgid ""
"Provides POS sessions, product selection, customer orders, payment recording"
" and receipts. Payment terminals, online providers, restaurant-specific "
"workflows and hardware require the relevant integrations and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ph
msgid ""
"Provides Philippine chart, tax and journal configuration with partner branch"
" and revenue-district fields for the supplied accounting flows."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_edi_ubl_cii
msgid ""
"Provides XML import and export builders for the supported UBL and CII "
"invoice formats, including Peppol BIS, XRechnung, NLCIUS, E-FFF and "
"Factur-X. Adds invoice attachments and format-specific PDF packaging through"
" the invoice sending workflow. Format selection and output depend on "
"partner, company and invoice data; network delivery and additional "
"jurisdiction-specific rules are supplied by their respective addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mcp_server
msgid ""
"Provides a JSON-RPC endpoint with tools to inspect, search, aggregate, "
"create, update and delete records. Requires an enabled endpoint, an Odoo API"
" key with MCP scope and configured model and operation permissions. Clients "
"must support the implemented HTTP transport and protocol negotiation; access"
" remains subject to the endpoint limits and user permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_schedule_payment
msgid ""
"Provides a catalog of payment frequencies with codes, payroll schedules and "
"days per period. Links employee versions to the selected frequency and "
"checks that it matches the payroll schedule. Consuming addons can use the "
"day count to space payments; this module does not send bank payments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_spreadsheet_dashboard_document
msgid ""
"Provides a conversion wizard with dashboard group and access-group selection"
" and actions to open the resulting dashboard."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_self_order
msgid ""
"Provides a customer ordering interface, product availability, table "
"identifiers and configurable ordering modes. Payment methods require the "
"relevant self-order payment integration and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_debit_note
msgid ""
"Provides a debit-note wizard with date, reason, journal and optional line "
"copying. Links the new entries to their source documents and supports a "
"separate debit-note sequence."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_hr_recruitment_livechat
msgid ""
"Provides a demonstration live chat rule and scripted recruitment questions "
"for the jobs page. The addon loads only demo records and supplies no "
"independent production chatbot engine; recruitment and live chat behavior "
"come from its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_widget_model_viewer_demo
msgid ""
"Provides a demonstration model with an uploaded model file, filename, "
"category and description, plus forms using the viewer widget."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_order_tracking_display
msgid ""
"Provides a public-facing order-status display and updates it from "
"preparation-stage changes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_rust_engine
msgid ""
"Provides a server-wide loader for the engine_py extension and its ORM read-"
"routing hooks. Supports off, shadow and active modes, model filters and "
"fallback controls. Shadow mode returns Python results while recording "
"comparisons. Requires the built extension and server-wide loading "
"configuration; routing defaults to off. This addon is marked non-installable"
" and is loaded through its post-load hook."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_threed_building
msgid ""
"Provides a warehouse building editor with wall segments, doors, windows and "
"roof parameters. Calculates geometric quantities and cost estimates from "
"entered dimensions and unit prices."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_task_mirror
msgid ""
"Provides a wizard to copy a task into a selected project with chosen "
"assignees and a dependency link. The new task is a separate record; the link"
" does not synchronize subsequent edits."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_account
msgid ""
"Provides abstract invoice-status and quantity calculations, order-to-invoice"
" creation helpers, document import and matching report models. Extends "
"accounting moves and lines with common order-link behavior. Concrete sales "
"and purchase integrations supply their order types and business actions; the"
" infrastructure has no standalone order application."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade
msgid ""
"Provides abstract order and line mixins for workflow, totals, pricing, "
"merging, templates and reporting. Adds shared order configuration and "
"contact order statistics. Sales and purchasing addons define the concrete "
"business orders and their application interfaces."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mixin_report_sql
msgid ""
"Provides abstract report-query composition, materialized-view lifecycle and "
"rolling-window refresh helpers. Consuming models supply their queries, "
"fields and refresh configuration. This addon provides report infrastructure "
"rather than a business report dataset or dashboard."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ge
msgid ""
"Provides account and account-group templates, taxes, fiscal positions and "
"company defaults for the Georgian chart, plus a country tax report. Requires"
" company chart setup and appropriate transaction configuration; the module "
"does not submit returns to a tax authority."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_lk
msgid ""
"Provides account, tax-group, tax and fiscal-position templates with company "
"and journal defaults. Adds formula-report definitions for VAT-001 and "
"WHT-001 and depends on withholding-tax support. Requires applying the "
"country chart and configuring transactions; report definitions do not "
"perform electronic filing."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_agro_base
msgid ""
"Provides agronomic catalogs, organism roles and interactions, soil and "
"fertilizer parameters, crop varieties, partner plots and seasonal campaigns."
" Adds product links and calculation helpers for thermal time, water demand, "
"nutrient requirements and salinity response. These calculations use the "
"supplied parameters and input observations; operational data collection and "
"agronomic interpretation remain outside the catalog models."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech_analysis
msgid ""
"Provides an analysis mixin and finding records linked to a recording owner, "
"plus speaker-level analysis fields. Uses the extraction and model "
"dependencies when a completed transcript is ready or analysis is requested. "
"Requires configured analysis services and company policy; generated findings"
" are model interpretations for review."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_catalog_xiuman_data
msgid ""
"Provides an installation loader for the bundled Xiuman catalog sections and "
"entries. Matches existing catalog content to update it and links products "
"where the loader can resolve them. Content is a repository snapshot rather "
"than a live product feed; resulting links and registration fields depend on "
"the target database."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment
msgid ""
"Provides applicants, job-specific recruitment stages, sources, refusal "
"reasons and talent pools. Links interviews to calendar events and supports "
"creating employee records from applicants. Public job listings and online "
"applications are supplied by the website recruitment addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval
msgid ""
"Provides approval categories, requests, approver steps, decision records, "
"delegation and escalation. Supplies mixins and bindings for consuming models"
" to enforce configured approval workflows. The application menu and generic "
"request categories are supplied by the separate Approvals application addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_attendance
msgid ""
"Provides attendance records, kiosk and user-menu entry points, employee "
"attendance status and reporting. Calculates worked time and overtime using "
"configured schedules and overtime rules. Kiosk identification, optional "
"automatic check-out and approval behavior depend on company settings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_contract_salary
msgid ""
"Provides benefit and personal-information configuration, employee or "
"applicant offers, package calculations and signature requests. Country-"
"specific payroll calculations require the appropriate extensions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp
msgid ""
"Provides bills of materials, manufacturing orders, component consumption, "
"finished products, by-products and unbuild orders. Inventory routes and "
"work-center settings determine the production workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_telegram
msgid ""
"Provides bot conversations and Mini App forms for task creation, editing and"
" closing. Optional configured AI services extract task drafts from text, "
"audio or images according to model capabilities."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_telegram
msgid ""
"Provides bot credentials, webhook registration and authentication, linked "
"chats, command routing, message records and outbound API helpers, with the "
"number a Telegram account shared as its own and the delivery health of each "
"chat. Adds chat-flow state, rate limiting and retry-response reuse. Requires"
" a Telegram bot token, reachable webhook and configured commands; business "
"operations such as attendance and approvals belong to extension addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_calendar
msgid ""
"Provides calendar events, attendees, invitations, reminders and recurrence "
"handling. Includes appointment offers, public booking pages and resource "
"allocation records. Booking availability depends on configured offers, "
"schedules and resources."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marketing_card
msgid ""
"Provides card templates, campaign-specific dynamic content, preview images "
"and tracked sharing links. Mailing integration generates cards for selected "
"recipients."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_credential
msgid ""
"Provides company-scoped credential records, typed credential fields, "
"validation hooks, access logs and OAuth helpers. Encryption requires "
"ODOO_API_ENCRYPTION_KEY. Integrations must explicitly use these records or "
"the encryption mixin; installing the vault does not migrate arbitrary "
"secrets. Certificate parsing and signing belong to the certificate addon."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_abc_classification
msgid ""
"Provides configurable classification profiles, warehouse scope, historical "
"levels, seasonal analysis and demand forecasts. Reordering calculations use "
"the available demand and lead-time data; profiles control whether computed "
"levels are applied."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_data_cleaning
msgid ""
"Provides configurable cleaning and matching rules, candidate review, merge "
"actions and scheduled processing. The selected models, matching thresholds "
"and merge settings determine which records are affected."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Provides conversion wizards with destination project or helpdesk team and "
"stage selection."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_slides
msgid ""
"Provides course channels, lessons, resources, participant enrollment and "
"progress records. Includes website learning pages and quiz-related "
"completion tracking. Access follows course visibility and enrollment "
"settings; external media require access to their hosting services."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_demo
msgid ""
"Provides demo accounts and streams for the bundled social providers, with "
"overrides for posting, statistics, comments and selected upload "
"interactions. Intended for demonstrations with demo data loaded; the "
"implemented simulations do not establish complete isolation of every "
"provider operation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document_project_sale
msgid ""
"Provides demonstration folders, a project template, a service product and a "
"sales order combining Project Documents with project sales. It loads no "
"production data, models or views and does not add product folder-template "
"functionality independently of its dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_iot_drivers
msgid ""
"Provides device and interface base classes, connection management, action "
"and event routes, status pages and system helpers. Includes built-in "
"handlers for selected printers, serial scales, displays and other "
"peripherals; separate addons add further device families. Requires a "
"compatible host and device-specific libraries and permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail
msgid ""
"Provides direct and group conversations, mail routing, templates, followers,"
" notifications and activity scheduling. Supplies chatter mixins for business"
" records and browser calling components. Email delivery requires configured "
"mail transport; calls require compatible clients and network access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_document
msgid ""
"Provides document and folder records, tags, document types, version history "
"and trash handling. Includes sharing links, access membership, file "
"operations and links to business records. Access follows the configured "
"document and folder permissions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sign
msgid ""
"Provides document templates with signature and input fields, signing "
"requests, recipient roles and completion records. Includes invitation links,"
" portal access and downloadable completed documents. Optional authentication"
" methods and certificate features require their relevant configuration or "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_im_livechat
msgid ""
"Provides embeddable live-chat channels, operator assignment, visitor "
"conversations, scripted chatbot steps and feedback reporting. Includes "
"conversation tags and operator expertise settings. Human responses depend on"
" available operators; scripted answers follow the configured chatbot flow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_appraisal
msgid ""
"Provides employee appraisals, feedback templates, assessment notes and "
"goals. Supports configured appraisal intervals, invitations and links to "
"review meetings. Managers and employees supply the feedback and recorded "
"assessments."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr
msgid ""
"Provides employee records linked to contacts and resources, departments, "
"jobs, work locations and employment versions. Includes employee information-"
"change requests, departure actions and activity-plan integration. Payroll "
"calculation and recruitment pipelines are supplied by separate applications."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_plm
msgid ""
"Provides engineering change orders, stages, revision records and document "
"links for products and bills of materials. Supports configured approval "
"workflows and actions to apply revised bills of materials. Manufacturing "
"orders can inspect available changes and update their bill of materials "
"through the provided actions."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_event
msgid ""
"Provides event types, dates, slots, tickets, registration questions and "
"attendee records. Includes barcode attendance handling and scheduled "
"registration email workflows. Selling registrations and publishing event "
"websites require their respective integration addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_threed_demo
msgid ""
"Provides example area and object models with position, size, rotation, color"
" and optional custom model fields. Supplies views to exercise the renderer."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_exchange
msgid ""
"Provides exchange channels, transmission records, a protocol interface and a"
" mixin for business documents. Keeps business acceptance or rejection "
"separate from transport results. Concrete protocol addons supply document "
"preparation and counterparty operations; connections require the relevant "
"credentials and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_expense
msgid ""
"Provides expense records with receipts, employee and company payment "
"handling, approval actions and accounting links. Includes splitting, "
"duplicate-review and posting wizards. Posting and payment follow the "
"configured journals and workflow; customer reinvoicing requires the sales "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_forum
msgid ""
"Provides forums, posts, answers, tags, votes and moderation actions. "
"Includes website pages and configurable privacy and karma rules. Posting and"
" moderation permissions depend on the forum configuration and user access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_knowledge
msgid ""
"Provides hierarchical articles, editable content, access roles and sharing "
"controls, with templates and embedded application content."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_report_formula
msgid ""
"Provides hierarchical report definitions, expressions, columns, options and "
"report exports. Includes expression evaluation and extension hooks for "
"custom handlers. Business-specific report definitions and data sources are "
"supplied by consuming addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_docs_xiuman_data
msgid ""
"Provides installation loaders for prepared Xiuman document content and "
"label-to-product pairing data. Product matching relies on the expected "
"database identifiers and catalog; missing products can be skipped or created"
" by specific label setup rules. Label PDF artwork requires the configured "
"external directory and can be absent even when label text loads."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_studio
msgid ""
"Provides interfaces for creating applications and menus and editing "
"supported model, view, action and report definitions. Tracks customization "
"records and supports exporting them as a module archive. Customization "
"actions require the relevant administrative access and remain subject to the"
" supported editor operations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account
msgid ""
"Provides journals, accounts, taxes, customer invoices, vendor bills, payment"
" registration and reconciliation. Configuration determines the chart of "
"accounts and available accounting workflows; country-specific requirements "
"use localization addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mass_mailing
msgid ""
"Provides mailing lists, contact subscriptions, email layouts, scheduled "
"sends and mailing statistics. Sending requires a configured mail service and"
" recipient lists; open and click metrics reflect the tracking events "
"received."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_maintenance
msgid ""
"Provides maintenance orders, plans, team assignment and resource or asset "
"links. Tracks maintenance dates and service-history metrics and supports "
"configured resource blocking. Scheduling and reported metrics depend on "
"entered orders, plans and asset information."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_lunch
msgid ""
"Provides meal suppliers, products, toppings, ordering locations and employee"
" lunch orders. Tracks lunch cash movements and balances and supports "
"configured order and notification schedules. The lunch balance records "
"account for recorded movements; they do not constitute bank transfers."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_data_recycle
msgid ""
"Provides model-specific selection domains, reviewable candidate records and "
"scheduled processing. Rules select archive or deletion and manual or "
"automatic execution."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mrp_mps
msgid ""
"Provides period-based forecasts, target stock and replenishment quantities "
"with actual-demand and supply comparisons. Can launch replenishment using "
"configured manufacturing or purchasing routes."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_todo
msgid ""
"Provides personal task views, onboarding items and a creation wizard with "
"assignee and deadline. Selected to-do items can be converted into project "
"tasks."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_planning
msgid ""
"Provides planning slots, roles, templates and recurring shift generation. "
"Includes scheduling views, publication actions and employee pages for "
"supported assignment and shift-change actions. Availability and allocation "
"depend on configured resources, working schedules and planning settings."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_pos_enterprise
msgid ""
"Provides preparation displays, order-stage management and preparation-time "
"reports with POS integration. Displays and stages must be configured for the"
" relevant POS."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_sale
msgid ""
"Provides product pages, shopping carts, checkout, customer order pages and "
"sales-order creation. Online payment and shipping options depend on "
"configured providers and delivery integrations."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project
msgid ""
"Provides projects, task workflows, assignees, dependencies, milestones and "
"customer sharing. Includes project risks, baselines, sprints, retrospectives"
" and progress reports; optional integrations add timesheets and financial "
"data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_scraper
msgid ""
"Provides provider and account models, queued runs, retry handling and "
"retained execution evidence. Portal-specific login, extraction and record "
"processing require provider extensions; browser runs require the browser "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_machine_learning
msgid ""
"Provides provider and model catalogs, operation-specific clients, routing "
"and configured fallback chains for supported text and audio operations. "
"Applies company and purpose policies and records request usage. Requires "
"suitable provider credentials and models; available capabilities depend on "
"the configured operation and service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment
msgid ""
"Provides provider configuration, payment forms, transaction states and hooks"
" for payment operations. Provider addons implement service-specific "
"requests; capture, refunds and tokenization are available only when "
"supported by the selected provider."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_purchase
msgid ""
"Provides purchase quotations, orders, templates, supplier pricing and order "
"analysis. Links vendor bills to purchase lines and supports bill matching "
"and down-payment workflows. Inventory receipts, tenders and purchase "
"agreements are supplied by their respective integration addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_quality
msgid ""
"Provides quality control-point definitions, check records with pass or fail "
"actions, sampling rules and alert stages. Quality execution interfaces, "
"measurement-specific fields and manufacturing integration are supplied by "
"extension modules; this addon defines the shared records and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_power_user
msgid ""
"Provides query execution, paginated SQL results, PDF output and a Python-"
"script console for the Power User manager group. These actions execute "
"server-side code and record an audit message."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_frontdesk
msgid ""
"Provides reception stations, visitor records, host selection, check-in and "
"check-out, and optional drink requests. Email and SMS notifications require "
"the corresponding configured delivery service."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_repair
msgid ""
"Provides repair orders with scheduling, warranty flags, technician notes and"
" stock movements for added, removed or recycled components. Links repairs to"
" sales orders and product traceability. Recorded repair completion updates "
"the workflow and related movements; physical repair work remains a "
"technician activity."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_iap_mine
msgid ""
"Provides requests filtered by geography, industry, company size and contact "
"roles. Converts returned results into leads and tracks the request cost and "
"state; service credits are required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_rate_limit
msgid ""
"Provides reusable rate-limit accounting and configuration for callers that "
"explicitly invoke the limiter. Installing it does not automatically limit "
"every route."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll
msgid ""
"Provides salary structures and rules, payslips and pay runs, payroll inputs,"
" salary attachments and reporting. Country-specific rules, rates and payment"
" formats require the corresponding localization and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale
msgid ""
"Provides sales quotations, orders, templates, product configuration and "
"sales analysis. Includes portal confirmation options, payment links and "
"invoice creation from order lines. Physical deliveries and specialized "
"service fulfillment are supplied by their respective integration addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract
msgid ""
"Provides schemas, extractor registration, a strategy cascade and an "
"extraction mixin with result, missing-field and correction records. Supports"
" synchronous and queued extraction and a result-review widget. Usable "
"document formats and extraction capabilities depend on registered readers "
"and separately installed strategies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_scoring
msgid ""
"Provides scorecard, dimension and band records plus abstract subject, score-"
"line and catalog mixins. Supports measured and catalog-based observations "
"and queued refresh helpers. Consuming addons implement subject observations "
"and classifications; the engine evaluates configured weights rather than "
"supplying a universal predictive model."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_equity
msgid ""
"Provides security classes, issuances and transfers, valuation history, cap-"
"table reporting and beneficial-owner records, with portal views for the "
"relevant contacts."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_media
msgid ""
"Provides segment records, a timeline mixin and a browser playback widget for"
" adopting business models. Segments carry time intervals and owner links, "
"with overlap checks and retention hooks that stamp attachment expiry. "
"Transcription and speech analysis are separate extensions; this addon "
"manages the media structure and playback."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_demo
msgid ""
"Provides selectable payment outcomes and simulated saved tokens, captures, "
"cancellations, refunds and express checkout. No money is collected and no "
"payment provider is contacted."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration
msgid ""
"Provides services, connections, receiver authentication, request logging, "
"retry controls and response caching for adopting integrations. Includes "
"outbound OAuth and reusable inbound verification helpers. External "
"operations require configured connections and credentials; storing secrets "
"requires the credential encryption key in the server environment."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social
msgid ""
"Provides social accounts, streams, post templates, scheduled publishing and "
"statistics. Platform-specific addons implement account authorization and "
"publishing; available operations depend on provider access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_msds
msgid ""
"Provides structured safety-sheet sections, hazard and composition lines, "
"chemical-substance and UN-number links, and report templates. Shared "
"product-document helpers handle branding, revision dates and publication. "
"Transport information printed on sheets comes from their entered fields; the"
" linked catalogs and generated layout do not certify the accuracy or "
"regulatory adequacy of the authored content."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_survey
msgid ""
"Provides survey questions, answer records, invitations, scoring, quotas and "
"response statistics. Supports live sessions and configured completion "
"certificates or follow-up actions. Scores and certificates reflect the "
"survey rules configured in the database."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_incoterm
msgid ""
"Provides the Incoterm reference model, seeded records and maintenance views,"
" including translated names and archive status. Other addons reference this "
"catalog on their documents; this addon does not calculate transport charges "
"or enforce contractual responsibilities."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_trace
msgid ""
"Provides the lot/serial number record (product.trace) and each product's "
"tracking mode, naming sequence and name format. A lot identifies a batch of "
"units and a serial number exactly one unit; both are one record kind, chosen"
" by the product's tracking. Stock, expiry and asset addons extend it; this "
"addon keeps no quantities, locations or moves."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Provides ticket records, teams, stages, priorities and tags with assignment "
"and portal workflows. Tracks configured SLA deadlines and customer ratings "
"and supplies ticket analysis reports. Resolution and service-target outcomes"
" depend on recorded work and the configured rules."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_holidays
msgid ""
"Provides time-off types, requests, allocations, accrual plans and employee "
"leave balances. Includes approval actions, calendar integration and leave "
"reports. Entitlements and accrual outcomes follow the configured types, "
"schedules and plans."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_referral
msgid ""
"Provides tracked referral links, applicant attribution, points, reward "
"redemption and referral reports, with configurable stages and reward values."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock
msgid ""
"Provides warehouses, receipts, deliveries, internal transfers, reservations,"
" lots and serial numbers, packages, inventory counts and replenishment "
"rules. Optional integrations connect stock movement to purchasing, sales and"
" accounting."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website
msgid ""
"Provides website records, page editing, themes, menus, publication controls,"
" search and SEO metadata. Supports multiple websites and configured forms "
"that create permitted records. Online stores, blogs, forums and other "
"business websites are supplied by their respective addons."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_worksheet
msgid ""
"Provides worksheet template records linked to generated models, actions and "
"report views, with a Studio editing entry point. Consuming business addons "
"connect these templates to their operational records. Template design "
"requires the Studio dependency and appropriate editing permissions."
msgstr ""

