msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_trace_gps
msgid ""
"Reads the GPS history of each delivery vehicle. Leaving the warehouse "
"geofence departs its loaded trip with the GPS odometer and fuel, and a "
"delivery vehicle leaving without one raises an alert. Dwelling at a "
"customer's location verifies the stop; an outcome the track never visited, "
"an unplanned stop, harsh driving, refuelling and a silent GPS are recorded "
"on the trip. Entering the warehouse geofence records the return readings and"
" closes the trip once every stop has its outcome. The GPS times date the "
"departure and the return, and the kilometres of each leg follow the stops "
"the track verified, not delivered ones included. Requires warehouse and "
"customer coordinates and a GPS device linked to the vehicle."
msgstr ""

