#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_default
msgid ""
"Register the default website theme. Its visual components are supplied by "
"the Website dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_auth_signup
msgid "Register user accounts and handle password-reset invitations"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_frontdesk
msgid "Register visitor check-ins and notify their hosts"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_l10n_account_withholding_tax
msgid "Register withholding taxes when paying invoices and bills"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_crm
msgid ""
"Registers CRM lead-creation tools and their available parameters for AI "
"agents. The agent configuration controls when the tool is offered."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_mqtt
msgid ""
"Registers MQTT 5 connections through paho for mqtt and mqtts URLs, with "
"configured topic subscriptions, credentials and TLS settings. Outgoing "
"messages require a topic in frame metadata or stream configuration; a "
"reachable broker and active integration stream worker are required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_modbus
msgid ""
"Registers TCP and serial RTU adapters for integration streams using "
"pymodbus. Configured subscriptions select holding registers, input "
"registers, coils or discrete inputs; polling follows the stream heartbeat. "
"Requires reachable compatible hardware, register addresses and an active "
"integration stream worker."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech_local
msgid ""
"Registers a CPU transcription reader using sherpa-onnx with Whisper and "
"voice-activity models supplied in the configured model directory. Missing "
"required models make the engine unavailable; optional speaker models add "
"speaker labels. Shared models normally defer to peer engines, while complete"
" purpose-specific model sets select local processing first."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_threed
msgid ""
"Registers a backend view type for spatial areas and their items, with camera"
" controls and item rendering. Models using it must supply view definitions "
"and geometry data."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_barcode
msgid ""
"Registers a document barcode reader backed by zxing-cpp for supported paged "
"document types. Reads available page images, returns distinct decoded text "
"values and logs per-page decoding failures. Requires the declared decoder "
"dependency; downstream extractors interpret the decoded contents."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_widget_model_viewer
msgid ""
"Registers a form-field widget for 3D model files with interactive viewing "
"controls. A model file and a field configured to use the widget are "
"required."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_purchase
msgid ""
"Registers a purchase tool with a leader approval category. Resolves the "
"named supplier or conversation contact, requires catalog products for the "
"supplied lines and creates a draft request for quotation with conversation "
"origin and optional delivery date. Purchasing reviews and confirms the "
"result through the normal order workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_sale
msgid ""
"Registers a sales tool with a leader approval category. Resolves the named "
"customer or conversation contact and creates a draft quotation from supplied"
" lines, with unresolved products represented as notes. Links the quotation "
"origin to the conversation; sales users review the resulting quantities and "
"products before confirmation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_ocr
msgid ""
"Registers an OCR text reader using RapidOCR and the declared ONNX Runtime "
"dependency. Runs when the document reader cost ceiling permits it and "
"cheaper readers have not supplied text. Produces page-separated text for "
"downstream strategies; recognition and line structure depend on the source "
"image and OCR model."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_account
msgid ""
"Registers an approval-configured accounting tool in the conversation "
"catalog. It resolves a customer, parses the supplied invoice lines and "
"creates a customer invoice in draft with an origin link to the conversation."
" Accounting users must review and post the resulting invoice; this addon "
"supplies the tool definition, not transcription."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mail_mobile
msgid ""
"Registers mobile devices and sends messaging notification payloads through "
"the configured notification service. Adds mobile back-button handling for "
"messaging views; notification delivery requires a registered compatible "
"client and service access."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_project
msgid ""
"Registers project task fields for website forms and handles submitted "
"contact and description data. Requires a form configured for task creation "
"and an appropriate project; the addon uses the website form builder supplied"
" by its dependency."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_speech_ml
msgid ""
"Registers speech readers and writers that select eligible gateway models and"
" invoke supported transcription or synthesis operations. Model availability "
"depends on company policy, credentials, capabilities and request limits. "
"Requires usable service connections; adding a catalog record alone does not "
"implement a new provider protocol."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_extract_ml
msgid ""
"Registers text and vision extraction strategies using schema-generated "
"prompts and the machine-learning gateway. Requires a configured model "
"available for the company and extraction purpose. Text requests use document"
" text; vision requests send only the first rendered page and require a "
"vision-capable model. Model failures return no result to the extraction "
"cascade."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_cohort
msgid ""
"Registers the cohort view, its data aggregation and spreadsheet export. "
"Application models must define the date and measure fields for the analysis."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_grid
msgid ""
"Registers the grid view, cell update handling and availability hooks. "
"Applications supply the row, column and measure fields and the permitted "
"edit behavior."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_data_merge_helpdesk
msgid ""
"Registers the ticket merge action and connects it to helpdesk-specific "
"merging."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_mrp
msgid ""
"Registers tools with manager approval categories for creating a bill of "
"materials or a draft manufacturing order from supplied product and quantity "
"information. Bill-of-materials creation refuses missing catalog components. "
"Requires existing products and manufacturing configuration; created "
"production orders still need the normal manufacturing workflow."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_integration_websocket
msgid ""
"Registers ws and wss connections using websocket-client, with optional Basic"
" or Bearer credentials, custom headers and heartbeat pings. Incoming "
"messages become stream frames and queued frames select text or binary "
"output; requires a compatible endpoint and an active integration stream "
"worker."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_sale_expense_margin
msgid "Reinvoiced Expense Margins"
msgstr ""

