#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_payroll_dual_period
msgid ""
"Stores a second date range on pay runs and payslips and uses it in payslip "
"period names and the supplied PDF layout when both dates are set. Copies run"
" dates to newly created slips and validates date pairs. The company setting "
"controls field visibility; this addon does not replace the underlying "
"payroll calculation period."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hr_recruitment_skills
msgid ""
"Stores applicant skills, computes matching and missing skills and exposes "
"matching scores on recruitment views. Transfers relevant skills when "
"creating an employee."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_catalog
msgid ""
"Stores catalog branding, sections, product artwork and commercial copy, with"
" a print wizard and PDF renderer. Classification as registered, not required"
" or in process follows recorded registration numbers, the in-process flag "
"and section settings. It is an internal catalog classification and does not "
"query a registration authority."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_description_template
msgid ""
"Stores company-scoped HTML description templates and adds template selection"
" and an apply action to project forms."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_trade_competition
msgid ""
"Stores competitor offers, equivalent products, source information and "
"confidence, with currency, unit and configurable freight or financing "
"adjustments. Supplies shared order comparison and loss-recording helpers. "
"Sales and purchase bridges apply the direction-specific comparison; "
"calculated market prices reflect recorded offers rather than a live market "
"feed."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_project_task_description_template
msgid ""
"Stores description templates with company and project restrictions and adds "
"a selector and apply action to tasks. Checks whether the chosen template is "
"valid for its task. Users maintain the template content and apply it through"
" the supplied task interface."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_un_number
msgid ""
"Stores four-digit UN numbers, shipping names and hazard classes and adds a "
"product link to the catalog. Includes English reference names and protects "
"shipped entries against deletion. Additional entries can be maintained as "
"needed; the catalog does not derive a product’s transport classification or "
"certify shipment documentation."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_move_template
msgid ""
"Stores journal codes, account prefixes, partners and product lines for a "
"document-generation wizard. Supports journal entries, invoices, credit notes"
" and payment templates, with configurable amount distribution and product-"
"category selection. Journal and account codes must resolve in the selected "
"company; running a template creates a document rather than scheduling "
"recurring execution."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_mockup_studio
msgid ""
"Stores model, label and placement records and provides a browser studio "
"using the shared 3D dependencies. Queues server rendering and stores "
"resulting images in Documents. Requires suitable model meshes, label assets,"
" configured document folders and an available Blender executable; preview "
"editing and server rendering use those supplied assets."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_term
msgid ""
"Stores payment terms and their lines, computes schedule examples and adds "
"customer and supplier term defaults to contacts. Supplies reusable term "
"calculations and configuration views. Trade and accounting addons consume "
"the terms on orders, invoices and payments; this module does not create "
"those documents itself."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_wallet
msgid ""
"Stores prepaid-wallet accounts linked to accounting accounts, cards and "
"holders, balance observations, transactions and statements. Provides low-"
"balance indicators and scheduled consolidation of older snapshots. Data must"
" be entered or imported by a separate integration; this addon does not "
"itself post top-ups or consumption as accounting entries."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_scale
msgid ""
"Stores tare, gross and net weights, pallet counts, theoretical weights and "
"deviations linked to stock move lines. Adds product, location and operation-"
"type weighing policies and a bypass wizard with a recorded reason and user. "
"External station adapters populate the records; this core addon does not "
"connect to scale hardware."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_social_push_notifications
msgid ""
"Stores visitor push subscriptions and adds push posts to social campaigns. "
"Requires configured Firebase messaging credentials and browser permission "
"from each recipient."
msgstr ""

