#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_fleet_route
msgid ""
"Suggests the order of a delivery trip's stops from TomTom's routing with "
"live traffic, and stores the estimated arrival at each customer, with a "
"service time per stop. Opens the route in Google Maps for the driver. When "
"the trip departs, each seller gets a Telegram message with a WhatsApp link "
"to tell the customer the estimated arrival. While the trip is on the road "
"the arrival times are refreshed from the vehicle's GPS, and a delay above a "
"threshold is reported to the supervisor, the driver and the seller. The scan"
" wizard can read codes with the phone camera, and the trip sheet and "
"delivery slip print a QR code. Requires a TomTom API key held as a "
"credential of the outbound endpoint TomTom Routing (one per company, or one "
"without a company for all of them), warehouse and customer coordinates, and "
"linked Telegram chats."
msgstr ""

