#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_msds_bundle
msgid ""
"Turns each agrochemical News finding into a sales bundle for the commercial "
"team: one line per active ingredient with the dose the finding reports, the "
"suggested product in stock at the bundle warehouse (own brand first) and the"
" other in-stock products that carry the same active ingredient. Third-party "
"products are matched through their substances, loaded from a verified brand-"
"to-active-ingredient table. Stock is a snapshot refreshed daily and on "
"demand, and a product whose lots at the warehouse have passed their "
"expiration date is flagged; a bundle is a suggestion, not a reservation or a"
" price."
msgstr ""

