"When a salesperson on a departed traced trip collects a cash sale whose "
"customer takes the goods at once, and the vehicle carries enough unreserved "
"stock of every product of the order, the delivery leaves from the vehicle's "
"location and counts as delivered in the trip's balance. Otherwise it leaves "
"from the warehouse, as a counter pickup. What the vehicle does not sell "
"comes back with the trip's unloading."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
