"Folder configuration and the signing workflow are supplied by the "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_error_incident_autofix
msgid ""
"When an incident meets the policy -- a server error hit by an internal user,"
" often enough, in a module whose repository is mapped, under the daily cap "
"and the company's machine-learning budget -- queues a diagnosis run for an "
"agent runner. A real defect is handed to a fix run, which works in a clone "
"of the module's repository on a branch named after the incident. In shadow "
"mode the fix stays a proposal -- its diff, analysis and cost reviewed in "
"Odoo, nothing pushed; in live mode the runner pushes the branch and opens "
"the pull request, which error_incident_github follows. A regression is "
"diagnosed again with the history of the fix that did not hold. Read-only "
"runs get a read-only repository token."
msgstr ""

